<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ndaa Yimbwe yasonuu Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ndaa Yimbwe yasonuu</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili a mukaanda</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Taata Teofili, bu balayi bayesini usonuu mandaa mamayilimi nha kati a bisi. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Bo baleeli mo, mbii bwayeelili bisi mo kwaa babali bambaangi ba mamono misi, umata mu mbaandili na bakitii bayiisi ba mandaa ma Nziaambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Me ka bu naduki bubwe-bubwe moosi mamayilimi umata mu mbaandili, me natsimi ti bwafwaana, me sonuu kwaa we, mukuutu Teofili, mbii bu malandisini. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Me nisa buu paa we yaaba bubwe, ngwanya a mandaa ma bayiisi we.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tumu a Nziaambi ayaabisi mbutili a Yowani Mubootii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Mu taanga di Erode ali mutini a itinini kia Yuuda, mwali na ngaanga a Nziaambi mosi wa kuumbu Zakaria. Nde ali mu kaba la banguu ba bangaanga la kuumbu Abia. Mukari a nde ali Elisabeti, mosi wa mu likaanda la Aaroni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Bo baboolo bali balibweeye nha kulu a Nziaambi, na bo bakiduku bubwe-bubwe, mikele mioosi na tumini dia Pfumu. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Ka bo a bali na mwaana pe, mundaa ti Elisabeti ali ikumbu, na bo baboolo ali aka binunu. <verse eid="LUK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Iluumbu imosi, Zakaria akisa isala kia nde kia bungaanga ba Nziaambi nha kulu a Nziaambi, mundaa ti kii ali iluumbu kia kaba la bo mu usala. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Weti bwali ipfu kia isala kia bangaanga ba Nziaambi, bo bati zeke. Nha mbisi a uta zeke, Zakaria abwi mu ipa, mu ukoto mu mbuu ya ngira ya Pfumu, mu utsuu malimbi ma mupalisa luki la tsulu yimbwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Kaba loosi la baata lakuundi ku mbari mu taanga dia tsuyili a malimbi ma mupalisa luki la tsulu yimbwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Itsundu-a-tsundu, tumu a Pfumu amonii kwaa Zakaria, atemini nha koo kia babaala kia diki la tsuyili a malimbi ma mupalisa luki la tsulu yimbwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Bu Zakaria wamumoni, nde apamii na boomo bamubwiilili. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Ka tumu a Nziaambi aleeli kwaa nde: «Zakaria, aba na boomo pe, Nziaambi maayuu ndoombili a we, na mukari a we Elisabeti sa abutulu we mwaana wa baala. We sa luu nde kuumbu Yowani. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>We sa yaanga na uba na kinyi, baata balaa sa bayaanga mu mbutili a nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Mundaa ti, nde sa aba wumunene nha kulu a Pfumu. Nde a unywa viinyi na mala makimi mamukolo pe, ka sa aluulu mu Muheebili wa Ngira, umata mu moonyo a nguu a nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Nde sa akiingili baana ba Iseraeli balaa kwaa Pfumu, Nziaambi a bo. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Yowani sa asa isala kia Nziaambi mu muheebili na lituu, weti bia mubili Eliya. Nde sa uvuutu mitimi mia bataayi na mia baana ba bo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">Nde sa uvuutu mitimi mia bataayi na mia baana ba bo </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAL 3:23-24">Mal 3.23-24</ref></char></note>, mu ukiingili mayele ma bangaa kene paa baba balibweeye. Ni mu buu, nde sa ayiluu baata babayilimi mu Pfumu.»<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Ka Zakaria aleeli kwaa tumu: «Buni me kaayaaba ti mii mia ngwanya, mundaa ti me na mukari a me bisi aka binunu?» <verse eid="LUK 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Tumu avutili, aleeli kwaa nde: «Me ni tumu Ngabriyeli, wu li mu utemene nha kiinzi kia Nziaambi. Nde maatsinduu me mu umoo na we na uleele ndaa yimbwe yi. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Bu we heli usa imiini mu mandaa ma me, we sa ba baba, natee mandaa maa muyilimi mu taanga dia mo.» <verse eid="LUK 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Mu diina taanga dii, baata babakikebe Zakaria bakimii bu adiingi nha mbuu ya ngira. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Ka bu nde apali, nde a atuuyi utsuu na bo pe. Baata bayaabi ti, nde bayi monini a Nziaambi nha mbuu ya ngira: nde makulu asi biliimbi kwaa bo mu umweese ti nde ka baba. <verse eid="LUK 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Bu biluumbu bia isala kia nde mu nzo a Nziaambi biakuyi, Zakaria avutii ku nzo a nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Biluumbu bu bialabii, mukari a nde, Elisabeti, ayolili yimi na asweemi batsuungi bataana. Nde aleeli kutso mutimi: <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>«Mono mi Pfumu amaayiluu mu me, mu taanga di, nde maakuulu me mu ndaa yaba mu usa litsoro la me nha kulu a baata.»<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tumu a Nziaambi ayaabisa mbutili a Yiisu yikaayira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Mu tsuungi wa basamina, Nziaambi atsindii tumu Ngabriyeli ku ngaanda a Ngalili, ya kuumbu Nazareti, <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>kwaa nduumbu yali keni babaala uyaaba pe. Kuumbu a nduumbu me ali Mari. Ali balasina nde mu makweele kwaa baala la kuumbu Yoosefi, wa mu likaanda la Daavidi. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Tumu akoti mu nzo a nde, na wamuleeli: «Ba na kinyi, we luuli mu kolokolo! Pfumu li na we.» <verse eid="LUK 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Mari apamii kwa mifuri, mu mandaa maa. Nde atsimi mambiindili ma bwee la pili yi. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Ka tumu aleeli kwaa nde: «Mari, aba na boomo pe, mundaa ti we bayi bweese kwaa Nziaambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Mono, we sa yololo yimi na ubutu mwaana wa baala, we sa luu nde kuumbu Yiisu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Nde sa aba muutu wumunene, na baata sa bata nde mwaana a Nziaambi wa ku kati a yula. Pfumu Nziaambi sa aha nde mbata a ipfumu kia kaa a nde Daavidi. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Sa aba mutini a nzo a Yaakobi bilimi na bilimi, ipfumu kia nde a iba na manini pe.» <verse eid="LUK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Mari aleeli kwaa tumu: «Buni makaayilimi, mundaa ti me a nayaaba babaala pe?» <verse eid="LUK 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Tumu avutili, aleeli kwaa nde: «Muheebili wa Ngira sa ayiri nha yulu a we, na lituu la Nziaambi wa ku kati a yula, sa lifuu we mu posi a nde. Ni mu buu, mwaana wu we kaabutu, sa aba wa Ngira na sa bata nde Mwaana a Nziaambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Elisabeti, musi nzo a we, ka na yimi mu bununu ba nde. Nde sa abutu mwaana wa baala. Muutu wu bakita ikumbu, yimi la nde ka mu tsuungi wa basamina. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Mundaa ti, Nziaambi a ubaakono ndaa so mosi pe.» <verse eid="LUK 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Ka Mari aleeli: «Me mutee a Pfumu. Nyaala buba mbii buli mandaa ma we.» Na tumu asiisi nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mari ayimono Elisabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Biluumbu biaduki, Mari atemini, ayeni mawasa ku tsi ya milaanda ku ngaanda a Yuuda. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Akoti mu nzo a Zakaria, na abii Elisabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Bu Elisabeti ayuyi bwee la Mari, mwaana atsuli mu kinyi mu moonyo a nde, na Elisabeti aluuli mu Muheebili wa Ngira, <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>na aloyi mu mifuri: «Nziaambi siemi we nha kati a bakaasa boosi, na lisieme la nde sa liba nha yulu a mwaana wu we kaabutu. <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Me na ndi, paa nguu a Pfumu a me ayiri kwaa me? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Ka mono, bunzuyi muniingi a bwee la we, mwaana tsuli mu kinyi mu moonyo a me. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Kinyi kwaa we. We siiri imiini ti, Pfumu sa akuusu mi nde aleeli!»<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukuungu a Mari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Mari aleeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«Mu muwuumu a me woosi me nikiinzi Pfumu.<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>Muwuumu a me aluulu mu kinyi, mundaa ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:47">Nziaambi ni Muyobili a me.<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>Ka nde tooni usuusu misi mia nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">nha yulu a booyi la nde.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Umata lolo li natee mu mataanga makaayira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">makubu moosi sa mata me <char style="em">ngaa kinyi</char>.<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>Ka Nziaambi Puungu-lituu maayiluu mandaa ma manene mu me.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Kuumbu a nde yili <char style="em">ya ngira</char>.<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Ngebe a nde yili mu makubu na makubu, kwaa babubaankiinzanga nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Nde amweesi lituu mu mifuri mia nde, atsiali bangaa liwaa.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>Nde abwiisi mitini mu mambata ma bipfumu bia bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">na anaangili babakuluu, mu usuusu bo nha mbata ya tsiomi.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Nde ayutisi babakwa nzala mu biloo bibibwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">Abingi bisini mioo na mioo.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Nde abaasili Iseraeli, ni booyi la nde:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">mu ulibili ngebe a nde moonyi,<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>kwaa Abraami na bateeri ba nde, mu bilimi na bilimi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">weti bu alasini kwaa bakaa ba bisi.»<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Mari adiaali na Elisabeti helape batsuungi batata, tumake nde avutii ku nzo a nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbutili a Yowani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Taanga dia Elisabeti dia ubutu bu diatoori, nde abuti mwaana wa baala. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Bambaayi ba nde ba bebele na basi nzo ba nde bu bayuyi ti Pfumu amweesi ngebe dia nde dialaa mu nde, bayaangi na nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Mu iluumbu kia pwoombo, bo bayiri mundaa ukese imwamwaana. Batooni uluu kio kuumbu a taayi a nde Zakaria. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Ka nguu a imwamwaana aleeli: «Pia, a kuumbu yii pe, sa bata nde Yowani.» <verse eid="LUK 1:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Ka bo baleeli kwaa nde: «Mu basi nzo ba we, a uli na muutu ngaa kuumbu yii pe!» <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Ni mu buu, bo bafuuli taayi a mwaana mu biliimbi, ki kuumbu nde atooni uluu imwamwaana. <verse eid="LUK 1:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Zakaria aloombi itsuru kia bala mu usonuu, na asonii: «Yowani ni kuumbu a nde.» Boosi bakimii. <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Nhaa-na-tsi, Zakaria abaandii utsuu. Nde abili Nziaambi mu ndaa yinene. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Boomo babwiilili bambaayi ba nde ba bebele boosi. Mvuungu a mandaa maa moosi, yayeni mu tsi yoosi ya milaanda mia Yuuda. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Bo boosi babayuyi mandaa maa, bakitsimi na bafulusunu: «Imwamwaana ki buni ikaaba?» Ngwanya, koo kia Pfumu kiali na nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukuungu a Zakaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Zakaria, taayi a imwamwaana, aluuli mu Muheebili wa Ngira. Nde abaandii ubili, na aleeli:<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>«Mbilili kwaa Pfumu, Nziaambi a Iseraeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">bu nde akiingii kwaa baata ba nde na wabakuuli.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Nde atsindii bisi Muyobili wa lituu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">mosi wa mu nzo a Daavidi, booyi la nde,<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>mbii bu nde atsuuyi mu minywa mia mibili mia nde mia ngira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:70">umata bele pe.<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>Nde alasini kuulili a bisi nha mioo mia mitaata mia bisi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">na boosi ba bubaabele bisi,<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>nde amweesi bweese ba nde kwaa bataayi ba bisi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">na a adiimbili pe lilasina la nde la ngira.<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>Mbii bu Nziaambi asi lilasina kwaa Abraami, ni taayi a bisi,<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>mu ndaa ukuulu bisi nha mioo mia mitaata, paa diamusalila kwahele a boomo,<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>paa diba bangira na balibweeye nha kiinzi kia nde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">mu pasi iluumbu kia idiingi kia bisi.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>Ka we mwaana a me, we sa ba mubili a Nziaambi waku kati a yula,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">we sa tswaamina nha kulu a Pfumu, mu uyiluu kuulu a nde,<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>mu uyaabisa baata ba nde ti, nde li mu uyiri mu uyobolo bo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">mu nyaalili a masumu ma bo.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Mu ngebe na libweeye la nde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">Nziaambi a bisi sa ayalisa bisi mu liyalila la yula,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">lafwaanina na liyalila la nyanga ya ngwaali.<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>Mu uyalisa ba bali mu uba kutso pimisi na pwosi ya likwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">mu usuungusu taambi dia bisi mu kuulu a iyeenge<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.79 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:1">Yes 9.1</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Na mwaana akikulu na akihama mu muheebili. Nde ali mu tsi ya tsata, natee iluumbu ki amonii kwaa Iseraeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbutili a Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mataayi 1.18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Mu taanga dii, Kayisari Ongusta apalisi mukaanda watumi ti, baata boosi basonomo mu uyaaba litaanga la baata mu tsi yoosi. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Litaanga lii ni latsiomi li basiiri, bu Kilenio ali mutumi mu itinini kia Siria. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Boosi bayeni ku usonomo, pasi muutu mu ngaanda a nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Yoosefi, mosi wa nzo a Daavidi, amati ku Ngalili mu ngaanda a Nazareti na ayeni ka ku ngaanda a Betelemi, mu itinini kia Yuuda, ni ngaanda a mutini Daavidi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Nde ayeni kuu, paa basonomo na nduumbu a nde Mari wali na yimi. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Bu bali ku Betelemi, iluumbu kia Mari kia ubutu kiatoori. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Nde abuti mwaana wa tsiomi wa baala, wamudii matsaanda, wamusuusi mu idiilili kia banyama, mundaa ti a babayi mbuu pe mu nzo a bieenyi.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tumu a Nziaambi amonii kwaa bakebi ba biboori</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Mu itinini kia tsi yii, mwali na bakebi ba biboori bakila mu matsiee mu ukebe biboori bia bo. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Tumu a Pfumu amonii kwaa bo. Buzitu ba Pfumu bayalisi bo mu peembi na peembi, bamoni boomo balaa. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Ka tumu a Nziaambi aleeli kwaa bo: «A diba na boomo pe, ka me nadileeli ndaa yimbwe yikaaha kinyi yalaa kwaa baata boosi, <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Lolo li mu ngaanda a Daavidi, badibutuli Muvuuyisi, ni Kristo Pfumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Mono iliimbi ki beni dikaayaaba nde: beni sa disololo mwaana wa ikenyi wubadii matsaanda mu idiilili kia banyama.» <verse eid="LUK 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Itsundu-a-tsundu, mukaanga a batumu ba mayula avuutini na tumu a Nziaambi wuu, babili Nziaambi, baleeli: <verse eid="LUK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>«Buzitu kwaa Nziaambi mu kati a mayula, na iyeenge nha tsi, nha kati a baata ba nde atoono.»<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakebi ba biboori bayeni ku Betelemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Bu batumu basiisi bo na bavutii ku yula, bakebi ba biboori baleelisini: «Tsweendani natee ku Betelemi, dimonani mandaa ma mayilimi ma Pfumu ayaabisi bisi.» <verse eid="LUK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Bayeni mawasa, basolili Mari na Yoosefi na mwaana wa ikenyi wubalaasa mu idiilili kia banyama. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Bu bo bamoni nde, bayaabisi mandaa ma tumu a Nziaambi ayaabisi bo, mundaa a imwamwaana kii. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Bo boosi bayuyi mo, bakimii mu mi bakebi ba biboori baleeli kwaa bo. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Ka Mari akebi mandaa maa moosi bubwe mu mutimi a nde, na akitsimi mu mo. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Bakebi ba biboori bavutii, bakiinzi na babili Nziaambi mu moosi ma bayuyi na ma bamoni, mbii bu tumu a Nziaambi aleeli kwaa bo.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kesili na kuumbu a Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Biluumbu pwoombo nha mbisi a mbutili, taanga dia ukese mwaana bu diatoori, bamuluyi kuumbu Yiisu, mbii bwayaabisi tumu, bu nguu a nde ali keni yimi ubaa pe.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mweesili a Yiisu mu nzo a Nziaambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Biluumbu bia tsieemini a bo bu biatoori, weti bu li mikele mia Mooso, Yoosefi na Mari babiti mwaana ku Yeruselemi. Bo babiti nde kuu, mu umweese nde kwaa Pfumu, <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>mbii bu basonuu mu mikele mia Pfumu: «Pasi mwaana wa tsiomi wa baala, sa aba wa ngira wa Pfumu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Pal 13.2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:11-13">11-13</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Bo baha ka mu bungori, «biduduu bioolo so baana boolo ba mabeembe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:8">Mik 12.8</ref></char></note>» mbii bu baleeli mu mikele mia Pfumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Ka mono, mu Yeruselemi mwali na muutu wa kuumbu Simeoni, ni muutu walibweeye na wakangama mu Nziaambi. Nde akikebe muvuuyisi a Iseraeli. Muheebili wa Ngira ali na nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Muheebili wa Ngira akwiyaabisa kwaa nde ti: «We a ukwa pe, natee bu we umono Kristo wa Pfumu.» <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Muheebili wa Ngira abiti Simeoni ku nzo a Nziaambi. Mu taanga dii, Mari na Yoosefi babiti imwamwaana Yiisu mu nzo muu, paa bakuusu mikele mia Pfumu mu nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simeoni wamuholi mu mioo mia nde, avutili matoondo kwaa Nziaambi, aleeli:<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>«Pfumu, mu taanga di ndasina dia we dimaakuu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">nyaala booyi la we liwuumu mu iyeenge.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Mundaa ti, misi mia me mimaamono liyobolo la we,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>ni liyobolo li we ayiluu kwaa baata boosi:<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>Ni liyalila la nziaabisi a we kwaa matsi moosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">na likaaba buzitu kwaa baata ba we, Iseraeli.»<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbilili a Simeoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Taayi na nguu a Yiisu bakimii, mu mandaa ma Simeoni aleeli mu imwamwaana. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Simeoni asiemi bo, aleeli kwaa Mari nguu a Yiisu: «Mono mwaana wuunawu sa aba mbwiilili na teminini a babalayi mu Iseraeli. Na nde sa aba iliimbi ki baata bakaahele uyuhusunu. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>Nde sa asuusu nha liyalila matsimi ma masweeme mu mitimi mia baata balaa. Ka Mari, we sa mono pasi dialaa, weti muutu wubamaapii mukasa.»<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aana mubili wa mukaasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Kwali ka Aana, mubili wa mukaasa, mwaana a Fanuweli, wa mu ifuumbu kia Aseri. Nde ali na bilimi bialaa. Nde adiaali na mulumi a nde, ndila bilimi tsaamba, umata bu akweeli nde mu buduumbu ba nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>Nde asiaali mukwiili, natee mu iteesi kia bilimi maku pwoombo na bina (84). Nde a asiisi nzo a Nziaambi pe, ka asialili Nziaambi mu udii mutuutu na ukuundu butsuu na nyanga. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Nde ka atoori mu taanga dii, avutili matoondo kwaa Nziaambi, atsuuyi mu mwaana kwaa baata boosi, babakikebe ti Nziaambi akuulu Yeruselemi.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvutii ku Nazareti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Bu bamani uyiluu mandaa moosi mbii buli mikele mia Pfumu, bibuti bia Yiisu biavutii ku Ngalili, ku ngaanda a bo ya Nazareti. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Mwaana akikulu, akihama, akiluulu mu buyeri. Bweese ba Nziaambi bali nha yulu a nde.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu mu nzo a Nziaambi nha kati a miyiisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Taayi na nguu a Yiisu, bakiyene pasi ilimi ku Yeruselemi mu mukuungi a Paaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Yiisu bu atoosi bilimi kuumi na bioolo, bo bayeni kuu mbii bwali ipfu kia mukuungi. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Bu mukuungi awiiri, na bo bavutii, mwaana a bo Yiisu asiaali ku Yeruselemi, ka taayi na nguu a bayaabi buu pe. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Mu matsimi ma bo, Yiisu ali mu kaba la bambaayi babavuuti kuulu na bo. Bo bayeni kuulu ya iteesi kia iluumbu ki ibiimbili, bamusiayi nha kati a basi nzo ba bo, na babayabisina na bo. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Ka bu bamukooni usololo, bavutii ku Yeruselemi mu usaa nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Nha mbisi a biluumbu bitata, tumi bamusolili mu nzo a Nziaambi mu nde ali adiaala nha kati a bakuutu ba mikele, akiyuululu bo na ufuulu bo manduru. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Boosi babakiyuu Yiisu, bakimii mu mayele na mu mamvutu ma nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Bu taayi na nguu a nde bamumoni, bo bakimii. Nguu a nde wamuleeli: «Mwaana, mu ima we siiri bisi bu? Mono, bisi a taayi a we dimaasaa we mu tsoongo.» <verse eid="LUK 2:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Nde avutili kwaa bo: «Mu ima dili mu usaa me? Ka beni a diyaaba pe ti, me nafwaana uba mu mandaa ma taayi a me?» <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Ka a bayaabi pe mandaa ma nde aleeli kwaa bo. <verse eid="LUK 2:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Yiisu avutii na bo ku Nazareti. Nde ali akuluu nha kulu a bo. Nguu a nde akebi bubwe mandaa maa moosi mu mutimi a nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Yiisu akuli mu mutele, mu buyeri, na abayi bweese kwaa Nziaambi na kwaa baata.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Nziisili a Yowani Mubootii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mataayi 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Malako 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yowani 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Mu ilimi kia kuumi na bitaana kia tumini a mutini Tibere Kayisari, Ponse Pilato akitumu mu itinini kia Yuuda, Erode akitumu mu itinini kia Ngalili, Filipo ni mwaana a nguu a nde, akitumu mu bitinini bia Ituraya na Trakoniti, na Lisanya akitumu mu Abilene. <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Mu taanga di Aana na Kayifa bali banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi, mandaa ma Nziaambi mayuyini mu tsi ya tsata kwaa Yowani, ni mwaana a Zakaria. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Yowani ayeni mu itinini kioosi kiadiengelele Yorodaani. Nde akiyaabisa kwaa baata boosi: «Disobo ndiaatili a beni, diholo libootuu. Tumake, Nziaambi sa asa masumu ma beni kolokolo.»<verse eid="LUK 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Mbii bu basonuu mu mukaanda a Yeesaya, mubili:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">«Ndaa mosi yili mu uloo mu tsi ya tsata:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">Yiluwani kuulu a Pfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">suungusani misoo mia nde!<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Pasi mbeenge sa baluusu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">milaanda mioosi na bibindi bioosi sa bakululu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">pasi muli na mafutu sa basuungusu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">makuulu ma mamanya sa balenge.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Baata boosi sa bamono liyobolo la Nziaambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Yes 40.3-5</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Makoongi mayiri kwaa Yowani mu uholo libootuu. Nde wabaleeli: «Beni ifuumbu kia bapili! Na wadiyiisi mu usaa ubata kesi a Nziaambi, yi ka bebele? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Dimweese mbutu dili mu uta imbaangi ki ibwe mu kiingili a mayele ma beni, ka a dileele pe mu matsimi ma beni: “Abraami li kaa a bisi.” Ka me nadileeli: Nziaambi utuu ukitisi mamanya ma, mu uba bateeri ba Abraami! <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Ka lolo, pibi yimaayilimi mu ukese muti nha miaanzi: Pasi muti wu uhele ubutu mbutu dimbwe, sa bakwaanga na udumunu nde ku mbaa.» <verse eid="LUK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Makoongi mamufuuli, maleeli: «Ka ima diafwaana usa?» <verse eid="LUK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Nde avutili, aleeli kwaa bo: «Pasi wuli na bikutu bioolo, aha imosi kwaa wahele na ikutu. Wuli na bia udia, asa pili mosi.» <verse eid="LUK 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Batoli ba limaanda bayiri ka mu uholo libootuu, baleeli kwaa Yowani: «Muyiisi, buni diafwaana usa?» <verse eid="LUK 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Nde avutili kwaa bo: «A diholo pe tala yavulu nha yulu a yibakese.» <verse eid="LUK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Masodaare ka mamufuuli, baleeli: «Bisi ka buni diafwaana usa?» Yowani aleeli kwaa bo: «A dipatila mboongo dia muutu pe, na a difuundu muutu kwahele a toono pe, ka disiingi ndila mufutu a beni wu beni dili mu ubaa.» <verse eid="LUK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Bu baata bakikebe, na bu boosi bakifulusunu ti, helape Yowani ni Kristo. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Yowani avutili, aleeli kwaa bo boosi: «Me ndi mu ubootuu beni mu maamba, ka wuli mu uyiri avulu me mu lituu. Me a nafwaana so mu unyangila misiingi mia bikoori bia nde pe. Nde sa wadibootuu mu Muheebili wa Ngira na mu mbaa. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Nde akaanga iyengese mu koo kia nde, paa asoolo mbutu dimbwe na usiisi bifufuri. Nde sa akukuu mbutu dimbwe ku yulu a ibaanga, na utsuu bifufuri ku mbaa yiyihele udimi.» <verse eid="LUK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Bu akita bibili bikimi kwaa bo, Yowani ayaabisi ndaa yimbwe kwaa boosi. <verse eid="LUK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Yowani asieembi Erode mundaa a Erodia, mukari a mwaana a nguu a nde, na mu mandaa moosi makimi mamabi mayilii Erode. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Nha yulu a maa, Erode abwiyiluu ndaa kimi yavulu bubi, nde aloosi Yowani mu perese.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Libootuu la Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mataayi 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Malako 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Baata boosi bu bamani uholo libootuu, Yiisu ka bamubootii. Bu akikuundu, yula ladibini, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>na Muheebili wa Ngira akulini mu ifwa-fwani kia beembe nha yulu a nde. Mu mayula mwayuyini ndaa: «We ni mwaana a me wa litoono. Mu we me ndi na kinyi yalaa.»<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakaa ba Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mataayi 1.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Yiisu ali hele maku matata ma bilimi bu abaandii uyiisi. Baata batsimi ti nde ni mwaana a Yoosefi, wuli mwaana a Eliya, <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>wa Matati, wa Levi, wa Meleki, wa Yanayi, wa Yoosefi, <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>wa Matatiasi, wa Amosi, wa Nawumi, wa Eseli, wa Nangayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>wa Maati, wa Matatiasi, wa Simeyi, wa Yoseki, wa Yoda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>wa Yowanani, wa Lesa, wa Zorobabeeli, wa Salatieeli, wa Neri <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>wa Maleki, wa Adi, wa Kosami, wa Elemedami, wa Eri, <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>wa Yiisu, wa Eliseri, wa Yorimi, wa Matati, wa Levi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>wa Simeoni, wa Yuuda, wa Yoosefi, wa Yonami, wa Eliyakimi, <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>wa Meleya, wa Mena, wa Matata, wa Natani, wa Daavidi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>wa Yese, wa Obedi, wa Booze, wa Sala, wa Naasoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>wa Aminadabi, wa Adamini, wa Arani, wa Eseroni, wa Peresi, wa Yuuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>wa Yaakobi, wa Isaki, wa Abraami, wa Tera, wa Nawori, <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>wa Saruki, wa Rangawu, wa Faleki, wa Eberi, wa Sala, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>wa Kayinami, wa Arafakadi, wa Semi, wa Nowa, wa Lameki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>wa Matusala, wa Enoki, wa Yaredi, wa Malaleli, wa Kayinami, <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>wa Enosi, wa Seti, wa Aadami, mwaana a Nziaambi.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Saatina asi Yiisu mapuusu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mataayi 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Malako 1.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Yiisu aluuli mu Muheebili wa Ngira bu amati ku Yorodaani, Muheebili wamubiti ku tsi ya tsata. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>Saatina wamusi mapuusu mu maku mana ma biluumbu. Yiisu a adi iloo mu biluumbu bii pe. Biluumbu bii bu bialabii, nde abayi nzala. <verse eid="LUK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Saatina aleeli kwaa nde: «So we ni mwaana a Nziaambi, leele kwaa manya li paa likituu lipa.» <verse eid="LUK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Yiisu avutili kwaa nde: «Basonuu: “Muutu a uba moonyi mu ndila lipa pe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Ndi 8.3</ref></char></note>.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Saatina wamubiti nha mbuu yanaanguu, na mu mwaana taanga hoolo, nde wamumweesi bipfumu bioosi bia tsi. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Nde aleeli kwaa Yiisu: «Me sa ha we lituu li loosi na busini ba matsi ma. Mundaa ti, bi bioosi baha bio kwaa me, na me utuu uha bio kwaa pasi nde wu me natoono. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>So we tsukini nha kulu a me, bi bioosi sa biba bia we.» <verse eid="LUK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Yiisu avutili, aleeli kwaa nde: «Basonuu: “Ndila Pfumu Nziaambi a we, we afwaana ukuundu, na usalila<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Ndi 6.13</ref></char></note>.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Saatina wamubiti ku Yeruselemi, wamusuusi nha yulu a nzo a Nziaambi, na aleeli kwaa nde: «So we ni Mwaana a Nziaambi, patuu na bwa nha tsi, <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>mundaa ti basonuu: “Nziaambi sa atsinduu batumu ba nde, mu ukebe we.” <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>Na “bo sa banaangila we mu mioo mia bo, paa kuulu kia we ihele ukubu baka mu manya<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Mkg 91.11-12</ref></char></note>.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Yiisu avutili, aleeli kwaa nde: «Basonuu ka: “A yesine Pfumu Nziaambi a we pe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Ndi 6.16</ref></char></note>.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Saatina bu amani usa Yiisu mapuusu mu makuulu moosi, nde asiisi Yiisu na tee mu taanga kimi.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbaandili a isala kia Yiisu mu itinini kia Ngalili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mataayi 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Malako 1.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Yiisu avutii ku itinini kia Ngalili, aluuli mu lituu la Muheebili wa Ngira. Mvuungu a nde yatsiaami mu itinini kii kioosi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Nde akiyiisi mu manzo ma makutunu ma Bayuudayo, na baata boosi bakibili nde.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Baata batuni Yiisu ku ngaanda a Nazareti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mataayi 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Malako 6.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Yiisu ayeni ku ngaanda a Nazareti ku nde akuli. Akoti mu nzo a makutunu ma Bayuudayo, mbii bwali ipfu kia nde mu iluumbu kia puumini. Nde atemini mu utaanga Mabasonuu ma Ngira. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Bamuhi mukaanda a mubili Yeesaya. Bu amani unyangila mukaanda wuu, nde amoni mbuu yibasonuu:<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>«Muheebili a Pfumu li na me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">mundaa ti nde abiaalisi me mu uyaabisa ndaa yimbwe kwaa bawele.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Nde atsindii me mu uyaabisa bunyanga kwaa makori,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">na monini kwaa bingimangimi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">na mu uvuusu babali kutso kwaamisa,<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>mu uyaabisa ilimi kia bweese ba Pfumu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Yes 61.1-2</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Nde afutii mukaanda, avutili nde kwaa musiali a nzo a makutunu ma Bayuudayo, tumake ni adiaali. Baata boosi babali mutso nzo a makutunu a Bayuudayo bamutali. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Nde abaandii uleele kwaa bo: «Mu iluumbu ki, mandaa ma beni dimaayuu mu matswi ma beni, mamaayilimi.» <verse eid="LUK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Boosi bati imbaangi ki ibwe mu nde, bakimii mu mandaa mamabwe mapali mu munywa a nde, baleeli: «Wu a ni mwaana a Yoosefi pe?» <verse eid="LUK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Nde aleeli kwaa bo: «Ngwanya, beni sa dita tsaba yi mu me: mubuyi, beeluu mu iwe-makulu. Moosi ma bisi diayuyi ti we ayilii mo ku ngaanda a Kapernawumi, yiluu ka mo mu tsi a we makulu.» <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Ka nde abwileele: «Ngwanya me nadileeli: a uli na mubili so mosi pe, wububaasiingi mu tsi a nde makulu. <verse eid="LUK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>Mu ngwanya, me nadileeli: mu taanga dia mubili Eliya, mvulu asi bilimi bitata na batsuungi basamina kwahele a unoo mu tsi a Iseraeli. Tsi yoosi yakoti mu tsata yalaa. Mu taanga dii, mwali ka na bakwiili balaa mu Iseraeli. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Ka Nziaambi a atsindii Eliya kwaa so mosi mu bo pe, ka ndila kwaa mukwiili mosi wali mu Sarepita, mu tsi a Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Mu Iseraeli mwali ka na bangaa bwaari balaa mu taanga dia mubili Elisa. Bunu, so mosi pe mu bo abeelii. Ka ndila Namani, musi Siria.» <verse eid="LUK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Boosi mu nzo a makutunu ma Bayuudayo baluuli mu kesi, bu bayuyi mandaa maa, <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>batemini, bamupalisi ku mbari a ngaanda, bamubeyi na tee nha yulu a mbeenge a mulaanda wu batuungu ngaanda a Nazareti, paa bamukilimisi. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Ka nde ayoyi nha kati a bo, ayeni wa nde.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muutu wubali mu ukwaamisa kwaa muheebili wumubi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Malako 1.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Yiisu ayeni ku ngaanda a Kapernawumi, mu itinini kia Ngalili ku akiyiisi mu iluumbu kia saba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">saba: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iluumbu kia Bayuudayo kia puumini</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>Baata bakimii mu nziisili a nde, bu akitsuu na lituu. <verse eid="LUK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Mu nzo a makutunu ma Bayuudayo, mwali na muutu wali na muheebili wumubi. Nde aloyi mu ndaa yinene na aleeli: <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>«Aa Yiisu! Musi Nazareti! We yo ki ndaa li na yo na bisi? Mu ufuhusu bisi we yiri? Me nayaaba bubwe we na li, we ni wa Ngira wa Nziaambi.» <verse eid="LUK 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Yiisu wamusieembi, aleeli: «Wuru kele, pala mu muutu wu.» Muheebili wumubi abwiisi muutu wuu nha kati a baata boosi, apali mu nde, ka a wamumweesi pasi pe. <verse eid="LUK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Boosi bakimii, balelisini: «Yi ki pili a ndaa yi? Muutu wu li mu utumu miheebili mimibi, mu lituu na mifuri na mio mili mu upala!» <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Mvuungu a Yiisu yatsiaamii mu itinini kia tsi kioosi.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu abeelisi babeeri balaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mataayi 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Malako 1.29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Yiisu bu apali mu nzo a makutunu ma Bayuudayo, ayikoto mu nzo a Simooni. Buko ba Simooni wa mukaasa ali na baa la mifuri, babali mu nzo muu baloombi kwaa Yiisu, abeelisi nde. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Yiisu abaandini nha yulu a mubeeri, asieembi baa. Lo lasiisi mubeeri, nhaa-na-tsi, mubeeri uyaaba utemene na usalila bo. <verse eid="LUK 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Taanga bu diadiaami, boosi babali na baata bangaa bibeeri bia mupili na mupili mu manzo, babeyi bo kwaa Yiisu. Nde wababeelisi, bu anayi mioo nha yulu a muutu-muutu. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Miheebili mimibi ka miapali mu balayi, mialoyi, mialeeli: «We ni Mwaana a Nziaambi!» Nde asieembi mio, a anyaali mio mitsuu pe, mundaa ti mio miayaabi ti nde ni Kristo.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ayiisi mu manzo ma makutunu ma Bayuudayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Malako 1.35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Bukia ngwaali, Yiisu apali, ayeni ku mbuu yatakuu yahele a baata. Makoongi ma baaata mamusiayi, bu bo basolili nde, bo bayiri kwaa nde. Bo a batooni pe ti nde asiisi bo. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Ka Yiisu aleeli kwaa bo: «Me nafwaana uyaabisa ndaa yimbwe ya Ipfumu kia Nziaambi mu mangaanda makimi ka, ni mu ndaa yii Nziaambi atsinduu me.» <verse eid="LUK 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Na nde akiyiisi mu manzo ma makutunu ma Bayuudayo ma mu Yuuda.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu asooli miyii mia nde mia tsiomi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mataayi 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Malako 1.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Iluumbu imosi, Yiisu bu atemini nha peembi a diaanga la Ngenesareti, koongi yamupinyini mu uyuu mandaa ma Nziaambi. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Nde amoni mabootu moolo mali nha simi la diaanga. Balobi ba batswi basutii mu mo mu uswaa masiele ma bo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Yiisu akoti mu mosi mu mabootu maa, ni bootu la Simooni. Yiisu wamuloombi mu utakuu hoolo na simi. Yiisu adiaali mu bootu na abaandii uyiisi makoongi. <verse eid="LUK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Bu amani uyiisi, Yiisu aleeli kwaa Simooni: «Diyene nha maamba mali na musundu, didumunu masiele ma beni mu ubaa batswi.» <verse eid="LUK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simooni avutili, aleeli: «Muyiisi, bisi dimaasala butsuu bubiimbili, ka a dibayi iloo pe. Ka mu ndaa bu we leeli, me nidumunu masiele.» <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Nha mbisi a udumunu masiele, bo babayi batswi balaa na masiele ma bo mabaandii ukakuu. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Bo bati bambaayi ba bo babali mu bootu lilikimi mbila, paa bababasila. Bo bayiri, baluusi mabootu mo mamoolo mu batswi, na mo makeni udiaama. <verse eid="LUK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Simooni Peetero bu amoni buu, atsukini nha kulu a Yiisu, aleeli: «Pfumu, matuu nha pele a me, mundaa ti me ni ngaa masumu!» <verse eid="LUK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Simooni na babali na nde bateeti mu boomo, mu ndaa iteesi kia batswi balaa kibabayi. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Bambaayi ba Simooni ka: Yaki na Yowani, baana ba Zebedaayi bateeti mu boomo. Ka Yiisu aleeli kwaa Simooni: «A ba na boomo pe, umata lolo li, we saba mulobi a baata.» <verse eid="LUK 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Bu babeyi mabootu nha simi, bo basiisi bioosi, na baduki Yiisu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu abeelisi ngaa bwaari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mataayi 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Malako 1.40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Yiisu bu ali ku ngaanda mosi, muutu mosi wali nyutu yoosi yaluulu mu bwaari bu amoni nde, ayitsukunu nha kulu a nde, busu mu tsini. Nde wamuloombi, aleeli: «Pfumu, so we tooni, we utuu ubeelise me.» <verse eid="LUK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Yiisu asibili koo, wamubeembi, na aleeli kwaa nde: «Me tooni, ki beeluu wa we.» Nhaa-na-tsi, bwaari uyaaba uwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Yiisu wamutumi: «A yaabisa ndaa yi kwaa muutu pe, ka yene yamonuu kwaa ngaanga a Nziaambi, na ha bungori mu ubeeluu kwa we, mbii bwatumi Mooso. Sa iba imbaangi kwaa bo.» <verse eid="LUK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Ka mvuungu a Yiisu yavuli utsaamuu. Makoongi malaa makukini mu uyuu nde na ubeeluu mu bibeeri bia bo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Ka nde makulu akiyene mu mambuu mahele a baata mu ukuundu.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu abeelisi muutu wabobo binama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mataayi 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Malako 2.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Iluumbu imosi Yiisu akiyiisi. Bafarisi na bayiisi ba mikele bali nhaa. Bo bamati mu mala moosi ma Ngalili, ma Yuuda na mu Yeruselemi. Lituu la Pfumu lali na Yiisu, na ni mu lo nde akibeelese babeeri. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Mono babaala babeyi nha yulu a mbuu, muutu wabobo binama, bo basiayi mu ulooso nde mutso nzo, na ubee nde nha kulu a Yiisu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Bu bahele uyaaba nha bulooso nde mu nzo mu ndaa a koongi, bahaati ku yulu a siaangi la nzo. Bo batuli wuru na basutili mubeeri nha ikala kia nde nha kati a baata, na bamusuusi nha kulu a Yiisu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Yiisu bu amoni imiini kia bo, aleeli kwaa mubeeri: «Mbaayi a me, masumu ma we basiiri kolokolo.» <verse eid="LUK 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Ni mubuu, bayiisi ba mikele, na bafarisi na basonii ba bo babaandii utsimi na uleele ti: «Wuunawu ni na, uli mu utuu Nziaambi? Na utuu usa masumu kolokolo, mbii a ndila Nziaambi pe?» <verse eid="LUK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Yiisu ayaabi matsimi ma bo, wabaleeli: «Mu ima dili na matsimi ma pili yii? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>Ima kia avulu uleenge nha kati a uleele: “masumu ma we basiiri kolokolo” na “temene, yene wa we?” <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Me natoono ti, beni diyaaba ti Mwaana a Muutu li na lituu la usa masumu kolokolo nha tsi.» Yiisu aleeli kwaa wa bobo binama: «Me ndeeli kwaa we: temene, holo ikala kia we, yene ku nzo a we.» <verse eid="LUK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Nhaa-na-tsi, wa bobo binama uyaaba utemene nha kulu a baata boosi, aholi ikala kia nde, ayeni ku nzo a nde, akiinzi Nziaambi. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Boosi bakimii, baluuli mu boomo, babili Nziaambi, baleeli: «Iluumbu ki dimoni mandaa ma kimikimi!»<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ati Levi mbili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mataayi 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Malako 2.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Nha mbisi a nhaa, Yiisu apali, amoni mutoli a limaanda, kuumbu a nde Levi, adiaala nha mbuu ya isala kia nde, Yiisu wamuleeli: «Duku me!» <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Levi atemini, asiisi bioosi, na wamuduki. <verse eid="LUK 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Levi ayilii Yiisu ndaamba yinene mu nzo a nde. Batoli ba limaanda balaa na baata bakimi, badiaali na bo nha meese. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Bafarisi na bayiisi ba mikele ba bo, ba nhunhinyi na baleeli kwaa miyii mia Yiisu: «Mu ima beni dibaadia na dibaanywa na batoli ba limaanda na bangaa masumu?» <verse eid="LUK 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Yiisu avutili, aleeli kwaa bo: «Baata bali polo a bali na nzala a mubuyi pe, ka ndila babeeri bali na nzala a nde. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Me a nayiri pe mu uta balibweeye mbili, ka bangaa masumu mu ndaa ukiingili bo mayele.»<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu na ndiili a mutuutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mataayi 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Malako 2.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Bafarisi baleeli kwaa Yiisu: «Miyii mia Yowani na mia bisi mibaadii mutuutu, na mibaakuundu, ka mia we mibaadia na mibaanywa.» <verse eid="LUK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Yiisu avutili kwaa bo, aleeli: «Buni beni dituu utumu babayiri ku mukuungi a makweele mu udii mutuutu, mu taanga di mufuru a makweele akeni na bo? <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Ka mu taanga di bakaamaasa mufuru a makweele nha kati a bo, mu biluumbu bii, bo sa badii mutuutu.» <verse eid="LUK 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Yiisu abwita bo tsaba yi: «Muutu a ubaakaka iteendi pe mu ilwaata ki inyatii, na ubaamba kio nha ilwaata ki ikulu. Leeti, nde sa abiiyisi ikutu ki inyatii, mundaa ti, iteendi ki inyatii a kiafwaana na ikutu ki ikulu pe. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Pili mosi, muutu a ubaalooso pe viinyi lilinyatii mu mambiindi ma makulu. Ka so nde loosi lo, viinyi lilinyatii sa libulu mambiindi, lo makulu sa litsaamuu na mambiindi sa mabuluu. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Ka viinyi lilinyatii lafwaana mu mambiindi mamanyatii. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>A uli na muutu pe wuli mu ubwatoono viinyi lilinyatii, nha mbisi a unywa lilikulu. Mu ngwanya, nde sa aleele ti: viinyi lilikulu lavulu mu bubwe.»<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu na iluumbu kia saba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mataayi 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Malako 2.23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Iluumbu imosi kia saba, Yiisu bu akisabuu matsiee ma bele, miyii mia nde miakabi bele, bakolili mbutu dia bele, banyonhinyi na badi. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Bafarisi ba bamosi baleeli kwaa bo: «Mu ima beni dili mu usa mandaa ma mikele mialii iluumbu kia saba?» <verse eid="LUK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Yiisu avutili kwaa bo: «Ka a dia taangi pe masi Daavidi, bu nde akwi nzala na babali na nde? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>Nde akoti mu nzo a Nziaambi, aholi mapa ma baha bungori kwaa Nziaambi, adi mo ahi mo kwaa baata bali na nde. Bunu, ndila bangaanga ba Nziaambi bali na muswa mu udia mo.» <verse eid="LUK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa bo: «Mwaana a muutu li Pfumu a iluumbu kia saba.»<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muutu ngaa koo kiabobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mataayi 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Malako 3.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Mu iluumbu ikimi kia saba, Yiisu akoti mu nzo a makutunu ma Bayuudayo mu uyiisi. Muu mwali na muutu, wali koo kia nde kia babaala kiabobo. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Bayiisi ba mikele na bafarisi bakikete nde bubwe mu umono mbii ti Yiisu utuu ubeelese muutu mu iluumbu kia saba, paa basololo toono yi bo bufuundu nde. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Ka Yiisu ayaabi matsimi ma bo. Nde aleeli kwa muutu wali na koo kiabobo: «Temene, yiri nha, nha kati a baata boosi.» Muutu, atemini ayiiri nha kula bo. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Na Yiisu aleeli kwaa bo: «Me nifuulu kwaa beni: mu iluumbu kia saba, uli na muswa mu usa mandaa mamabwe so mamabi? Mu uvuusu muwuumu a muutu na so mu unyaala nde afuu?» <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Nde atali baata boosi, aleeli kwaa ngaa koo kiabobo: «Sibili koo kia we.» Nde asibili kio na koo kia nde kiabeelii. <verse eid="LUK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Bayiisi ba mikele na Bafarisi baluuli mu kesi, babayi imoo nha kati a bo mu yibafwaana usa kwaa Yiisu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu asooli batumu kuumi na boolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mataayi 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Malako 3.13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Mu biluumbu bii, Yiisu ayeni ku mulaanda mu ukuundu. Butsuu ba bubiimbili, nde ali kuu mu ukuundu Nziaambi. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Bu bakieeri, Yiisu ati miyii mia nde mbila, asiooli kuumi na boolo, wabaluyi kuumbu batumu. <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Simooni, wu nde aluyi kuumbu Peetero, Andere, mwaana a nguu a Peetero, Yaki, Yowani, Filipo, Baritelemi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Mataayi, Toma, Yaki, ni mwaana a Alife, Simooni wu bubaata <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zelote: muutu wa toono tsi a nde na uli mu ukala yo </char></note>Zelote. <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Na Yuuda mwaana a Yaakobi na Yuuda Isikarioti, wu ukituu muyeelili.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ayiisi na abeelisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mataayi 4.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Nde akulumini na bo, atemini nha mbuu ya ileese. Nhaa mwali na koongi yinene ya miyii mia nde, na koongi a baata balaa babamati mu tsi yoosi ya Yuuda, ku Yeruselemi. Babamosi ka bamati ku mangaanda ma Tiro na Sidoni, ni mangaanda mamali mu mukoo a mubu. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Bo bayiri mu uyuu nde na mu ubeeluu mu bibeeri bia bo. Ba miheebili mimibi miakikwaamisa, babeelii ka. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Koongi yoosi yasiayi mu ubeembe nde, mu ndaa lituu lakipala mu nde na lakibeelisi boosi.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Makinyi na mangebe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mataayi 5.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Yiisu bu asiimbili misi kwaa miyii mia nde, wabaleeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">«Kinyi kwaa beni bali bawele,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">ka Ipfumu kia Nziaambi ili kia beni!<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Kinyi kwaa beni bali nzala mu taanga di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">ka beni sa diyutuu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Kinyi kwaa beni bali mu ulili mu taanga di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">ka beni sa disiebe!»<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>«Kinyi kwaa beni, so baata bubele beni, so baata butunu beni, so baata butuu beni, so baata buleele mabi mu beni mu ndaa a Mwaana a Muutu. <verse eid="LUK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>Bu iluumbu kii ikaayira, diba na kinyi, diyaanga, ka mono, musieende a beni li wumunene ku yula, ka ni buu ka bwasi bataayi ba bo kwaa mibili.»<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>«Ka ngebe kwaa beni bisini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:24">beni dimaaholo mboondili a beni.<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Aa ngebe kwaa beni badili diayutuu mu taanga di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">ka beni sa dikwa nzala!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Aa ngebe kwaa beni badili mu usiebe mu taanga di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">ka beni sa diba mu bukwiili na matsanga!<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>Ngebe kwaa beni, mutaanga di baata boosi buleele ma mabwe mu beni, ka ni buu ka bwayilii bataayi ba bo kwaa mibili mia pia!»<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Litoono mu mitaata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mataayi 5.38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7.12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>«Ka kwaa beni ba dili mu uyuu me, me nadileeli: Ditoono mitaata mia beni, disa ma mabwe kwaa baata ba bali mu ubele beni. <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>Disieme babusibi beni, dikuundu mu ba butsoro beni. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>So muutu teti we mu tama limosi, wamumweese ka lilimosi. So muutu holi iyungu kia we, nyaala nde aholo ka ikutu kia we. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Pasi wu uloombo we, wamuha; wu holi bia we, a bwaloombo bio pe. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Pasi bu ditooni ti baata badisa, ni buu beni disa kwaa bo. <verse eid="LUK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>So ditooni ndila babatoono beni, mu ima buvutulu beni matoondo? Bangaa masumu ka utoono ba batoono bo. <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>So dili mu usa mandaa mamabwe kwaa ba bali mu usa beni ma mabwe, mu ima buvutulu beni matoondo? Bangaa masumu bali mu usa ka pili mosi! <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>So dili mu usoombuso kwaa ba badiasa ilimbisi ti sa bafutu, mu ima buvutulu beni matoondo? Bangaa masumu ka bali mu usoombusono mu ndaa ubaa futu! <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Ka ditoono mitaata mia beni, disa mandaa mamabwe, disoomboso kwahele a ukebe ndaanda. Musieende a beni sa aba wu munene, na beni sa diba baana ba Nziaambi wa ku kati a yula, mundaa ti, nde li wumubwe kwaa ba buhele uvutulu nde matoondo na kwaa bababi. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Diba bangaa ngebe weti taayi a beni ni ngaa ngebe.»<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">A difuundusu bambaayi pe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mataayi 7.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>«A difuundusu pe, na mbari Nziaambi ka a ufuundusu beni pe. A dibwiisi pe, na mbari Nziaambi ka a ubwiisi pe beni. Disa bambaayi kolokolo, na Nziaambi ka sa wadisa kolokolo. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Dikaba kwaa bambaayi na Nziaambi ka sa wadikaba. Sa baluusu mu pfwoolo a ikutu kia we iteesi ki ibwe ki bakomo, ki banyingisi, na kiapfwaabula. Ka iteesi ki beni dileesele bambaayi, sa Nziaambi sa aleesele beni ka mu kio.» <verse eid="LUK 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Nde abwi ta bo tsaba: «ka ingimangimi utuu ubiti mbaayi ingimangimi? Ka bo baboolo a bubwa mutso dunu pe? <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Muyii a avulu pe muyiisi a nde, ka pasi muyii wu ubaayii bubwe sa aba weti muyiisi a nde. <verse eid="LUK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>Ka mu ima li mu umono itiiti kili mu lisi la mwaana a nguu a we, ka muti uli mu lisi la weme amoni nde pe? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Buni utuu uleele kwaa mbaayi a we: Mbaayi, nyaala me maasa itiiti kili mu lisi la we, we makulu a amono muti uli mu lisi la we pe? We ngaa lisi kutso likaya, kwa maasa muti uli mu lisi la we makulu, tumake sa mono buni we utuu maasa itiiti kili mu lisi la mbaayi a we.»<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muti na mbutu dia nde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mataayi 7.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12.33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>«A uli na muti wu mubwe wu ubaa butu mbutu dimbi pe, tumake ka a uli na muti wu mubi wu ubaa butu mbutu dimbwe pe. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Ka pasi muti ayaabina mu mbutu dia nde. A bubaakaba mbutu dia bafiike mu muti wa matsieende pe, a bubaakaba mbutu dia viinyi mu mingaamba pe. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Muutu wumubwe li mu upalisa mamabwe mu busini ba mutima a nde wumubwe. Muutu wumubi li mu upalisa mamabi mu mutima a nde wumubi. Mu ngwanya, munywa a muutu upalisa mamaluulu mu mutima nde.»<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Manzo moolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mataayi 7.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>«Mu ima dibaata me “Pfumu, Pfumu”, ka a dibaayiluu pe ma nibaa leele beni? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Pasi wu uyira kwaa me na uyuu mandaa ma me na uyiluu mbii bu mali, me sa mweese beni wu nde afwaanina: <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>Nde afwaanina na muutu watuungu nzo. Akwi haa, asundisi na asuusi ibwa nha yulu a manya. Nyaamba ya mifuri yayiri, yabwiilili nzo yii, yo a yabwiiri pe, mu ndaa ti yo batuungu bubwe. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Ka uli mu uyuu mandaa ma me, na ali mu usalila mo pe, afwaanina na muutu watuungu nzo nha yulu a tsieengi, kwahele a ibwa. Nyaamba yabwiilili yo: mawasa-mawasa yo uyaaba ubwa, na mbwiilili a nzo yii yali yi nene!»<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu abeelisi booyi la mukuutu a kama a masodaare</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mataayi 8.5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Yiisu bu amani uleele mandaa ma nde moosi kwaa baata, akoti mu Kapernawumi. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Booyi la mukuutu a kama a masodaare wu nde atooni kwalaa ali na ubeele, nha peembi a likwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Bu ayuyi mvuungu a Yiisu, atsindii bakuutu ba Bayuudayo bamosi kwaa nde mu ya loombo kwaa nde ayiri a beelese mutee a nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Bu batoori kwaa Yiisu, bahanini mu upele nde, baleeli: «muutu wu afwaana ti we ha nde libaasila. <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>Ka nde atoono ifuumbu kia bisi, nde makulu wadituungili nzo a makutunu.» <verse eid="LUK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Yiisu ayeni na bo. Ka bu atoori bebele na nzo, mukuutu a kama a masodaare atsindii banduu, ba muleele: «Pfumu, a mono wa we pasi pe, ka a nafwaana pe ti we koto ku tsini a siaangi la me. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Ni mu buu, me natsimi ti a nafwaana uyira kwaa we pe, ka leele ndaa ndila mosi, na booyi la me libeeluu. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Me makulu ndi ku tsini a litumu la bakuutu bame, na ndi na masadara ma ndi mu utumu. So ndeeli kwaa mosi: yene! Nde yeni; kwaa wu mumosi: yiri, nde yiri; kwaa booyi la me: Yiluu ki, nde yilii kio.» <verse eid="LUK 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Yiisu bu ayuyi maa, akimii mu nde, asieetii, aleeli kwaa baata bakiduku nde: «Me nadileeli: So mu Iseraeli a nasololo imiini ki inene kia pili yi pe.» <verse eid="LUK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Babatsindii, bu bavutii ku nzo, babaasi mutee abeeluu.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu asiimbili mwaana a mukwiili mu babakwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Nha mbisi nhaa, Yiisu ayeni ku ngaanda ya kuumbu Nayini, miyii mia nde na koongi a baata yalaa bayeni na nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Bu asweesi nha kotili a ngaanda, mono bakibiti wakwa, mwaana wa baala ndila mosi wa nguu a nde wali mukwiili, na koongi yalaa ya mu ngaanda yii yali na nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Pfumu wamumoni, wamukwiilili ngebe, aleeli kwaa nde: «a lili pe!» <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Yiisu asweesi, abeembi mububulu, bababiti batsikini. Yiisu aleeli: «Mufuru, me ndeeli we, temene!» <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Na wakwa asiimbii, abaandii utsuu. Yiisu wamuvutili kwaa nguu a nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Boomo babwiilili boosi, bakiinzi Nziaambi, baleeli: «Mubili wu munene maa pala nha kati a bisi, Nziaambi maa yiri mu uyobolo baata ba nde.» <verse eid="LUK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Mvuungu a ndaa yayilii Yiisu yatsiaamii mu tsi yoosi ya Yuuda na mu mala madiengelele yo.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu na Yowani Mubootii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mataayi 11.2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Miyii mia Yowani mia muleeli mandaa maa moosi. Yowani ati miyi mia nde mioolo mbila. <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>Atsindii mio kwaa Pfumu mu ufuulu nde: «We ni wafwaana uyira, ooti diafwaana ukebe muutu mukimi?» <verse eid="LUK 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Miyii bu miatoori kwaa Yiisu bamuleeli: «Yowani Mubootii waditsinduu difuulu we: we ni wafwaana uyira, so a buu pe bisi diafwaana ukebe mukimi?» <verse eid="LUK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Mu taanga dii, Yiisu abeelisi baata balaa bangaa bibeeri, ba ngaa bifuumbu, baata bangaa miheebili mimibi, na abeelisi balayi babakwa misi. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Nha mbisi nde avutili kwaa miyii mia Yowani: «Yenani dileele Yowani ma dimoni na ma diyuyi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:22">Bakwa miisi bali mu umono, bitonzo bili mu udieenge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:22">bangaa bwaari bali mu ubeeluu, bakwa matswi bali mu uyuu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:22">ba bakwa bali mu usiimbuu, ndaa yimbwe bayaabisi kwaa bawele.<verse eid="LUK 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Kinyi kwaa pasi wuu heele ubwiisi imiini kia nde mu me.»<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Ka batumu ba Yowani bu bavutii, Yiisu abaandii utsuu mu Yowani kwaa makoongi, aleeli: «Ima beni diyimono ku tsi ya tsata? Liheese lili mu unyingini mu mupepe? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Ka ima beni diyimono? Muutu walwaata bikutu bia tala? Ka babali mu ulwaata milwaata mia buzitu na bali mu uba mutso busini bali mu udiaala mu manzo ma mitini. <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Ka ima beni diayamono? Mubili a Nziaambi? Ee-e, me nadileeli, nde avulu na paa mubili. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>Ni mu nde Yowani basonuu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">“Mono, me sa tsinduu tumu a me nha kulu we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">mu uyiluu we kuulu nha kulu a we.”<verse eid="LUK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>«Me nadileeli: Nha kati a babaala boosi babutuu mu mukaasa, a uli na wavulu Yowani mu bunene pe, ka bunu wavulu bukee mu Ipfumu kia Nziaambi avulu nde mu bunene. <verse eid="LUK 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Baata boosi na batoli ba limaanda bayuyi nde. Baleeli: “Nziaambi tooni bisi uyobolo!” Na baholi libootuu la Yowani. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Ka bafarisi na bayiisi ba mikele ba bisi ma Nziaambi atooni uyiluu mu bo, na bo babisi libootuu la Yowani.» <verse eid="LUK 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Yiisu abwileele: «Na me nifwaanisa baata ba kubu yi? Na na bafwaanina? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Bafwaanina na baana ba badiaala nha kooyi, bali mu ulohosono mu uleele: Difuli beni piipi, ka beni a dikini pe, diyimbili beni mikuunga mia likwa, ka beni a dilili pe. <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Ka Yowani Mubootii ayiri, nde ali mu udia mapa pe, ali mu unywa viinyi pe, ka beni dileeli: “Muheebili wu mubi li mu nde.” <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Mwaana a Muutu ayiri, nde li mu udia na li mu unywa, na beni dileeli: “Mono, muutu wu, matsimi ma nde moosi ndila ma udia na unywa mala! Nde li nduu a ba ngaa masumu na batoli ba limaanda.” <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Ka buyeri ba Nziaambi bumonii balibweeye kwaa baana ba nde boosi.»<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu mu nzo a Simooni Mufarisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Mufarisi mosi aloombi Yiisu adia na nde. Yiisu akoti mu nzo a mufarisi, adiaali nha meese. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Mwali mu ngaanda yii na mukaasa mosi ngaa masumu. Bu ayaabi ti Yiisu ali nha meese mu nzo a mufarisi, nde abeyi ibasa kia luulu mu mananaasa, <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>ayeni nha peembi a miili mia Yiisu nde. Alili, abolisi miili mia Yiisu mu matsanga, akoombili mio mu naanga dia nde, anyumbiti miili mia Yiisu, ayitili mananaasa nha yula mio. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Mufarisi wa tumisi Yiisu bu amoni buu aleeli mu mutimi a nde: «mbiiti muutu wu ali mubili, nde keni yaaba ti mukaasa uli mu beembe nde li ngaa masumu.» <verse eid="LUK 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Yiisu, aleeli kwaa mufarisi: «Simooni, ndi na ndaa ya uleele kwaa we.» Simooni avutili: «Muyiisi kileele.» <verse eid="LUK 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>«Baata boolo bali na yaama la musoombisi a mboongo, watsiomi, makama mataana ma mboongo, ka wu mumosi maku mataana. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Ka bu baheli na bia ufutu, wabanyaali bo baboolo. Na mu bo kaavulu nde utoono?» <verse eid="LUK 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simooni avutili: «Me tsimi ti nde wubanyaalili yaama lavulu bunene.» Yiisu aleeli kwaa nde: «We kesi bubwe.» <verse eid="LUK 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Bu asieetii kwaa mukaasa, aleeli kwaa Simooni: «We li mu umono mukaasa wu? Me koti mu nzo a we, ka we ahi me maamba ma uswaa miili pe. Ka nde swayi miili mia me mu matsanga ma nde, koombili mio mu naanga dia nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>We a nyumbutu me pe, ka nde umata kotili a me a akoono pe miili mia me unyumbutu. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>We ayitili maari nha yula mutswe a me pe, ka nde yitili mananaasa mu miili mia me. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Ni mu buu nadileele: nde amweesi litoono lalaa bu masumu ma nde malaa banyaali. Ka wu banyaala mama kee, amweesi ka litoono li likee. <verse eid="LUK 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa mukaasa wuu: Masumu ma we basiiri kolokolo.» <verse eid="LUK 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Ba bali badiaala na nde nha meese babaandii uleelesene: «Wuunawu ni na wu tuu usa masumu kolokolo?» <verse eid="LUK 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Ka nde aleeli kwaa mukaasa: «Imiini kia we ivuuyisi we: yene mu iyeenge.»<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Bakaasa ba baasili Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Nha mbisi, Yiisu ayeni midieenge mu pasi ngaanda na mu pasi bula mu uyiisi na uyaabisa ndaa yimbwe ya Ipfumu kia Nziaambi. Miyii kuumi na mioolo miali na nde <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>na Bakaasa bakimi ba babeelisi mu miheebili mimibi na mu bibeeri: ni Mari wu bubaata musi Mangadala, wu bapalisi miheebili tsaamba mimibi, <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Zaana mukari a mukebi a busini ba Erode wa kuumbu Kuza, na Suzaana na bakimi balaa bababaasili Yiisu na miyii mia nde mu mbayili a bo.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsaba ya mukuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mataayi 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Malako 4.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Koongi yalaa yakukini, mu pasi ngaanda baata bayiri kwaa Yiisu, nde ati bo tsaba yi: <verse eid="LUK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>«Mukuni mosi ayeni ku tsiee a nde mu ukunu mbutu, ka bu ali mu ukunu, ndaamba a mbutu yaki yena bwa mukuulu a kuulu, baata badiaati, na banyunyi bayula badi dio. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Dimosi diabwi nha yula a manya, bu diamani ukulu, dia kanyi mu ndaa ti a kwali nyototo pe. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Dimosi diabwi nha tso mingaamba. Diameni na mingaamba mbuu mosi, mingaamba mianyongisi dio. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Dimosi diabwi mu tsieengi dimbwe, diakuli, diabuti mbutu kama-kama.» Bu amani maa uleele, aloyi: «wuli na matswi ma uyuu, nyaala ayuu.»<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu ima Yiisu ubaatsuu mu matsaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mataayi 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Malako 4.10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Miyii mia Nde mia mufuuli Mambiindili ma tsaba yii. <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>Nde avutili: «Beni badihi mu uyaaba matsweeyi ma Ipfumu kia Nziaambi; ka kwaa ba bamosi mu matsaba bali mu uyuu mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">paa so bali na misi bwaasi a bumono iloo pe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">na so bayuyi a buyaaba pe.»<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu abiindili tsaba ya mukuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mataayi 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Malako 4.13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>«Mono mbiindila tsaba ni yi: Mbutu ni mandaa ma Nziaambi. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Dia mu kuulu a kuulu, ni baata bali mu uyuu mandaa ma Nziaambi. Ka Saatina li mu uyira mu umaasa ndaa mu mitimi mia bo, mu ndaa ti a basa imiini na ubaa liyobolo. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Dia nha yulu a manya ni babali mu uyaka mandaa mu kinyi, ka mo a mali na miaanzi mu bo pe. Bo bali mu usa imiini taanga ndila hoolo, ka mu taanga dia nziesini bo bali mu ubwiisi imiini. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Diabwi nha tso mingaamba ni baata babali mu uyuu mandaa. Ka minyoongo, busini na makinyi ma tsi, mali mu unyongoso imiini kia bo. Bo a bali mu utuu ubutu mbutu diayele pe. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Diabwi mu tsieengi dimbwe, ni baata bali mu uyuu mandaa mu mutima wafwaana na wumubwe. Bo bubaakebe mo na bubaabutu mbutu, kutso mukonono.»<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsaba ya mwiindi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Malako 4.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>«A uli na muutu wu unamisa mwiindi, mu ufuu nde ku tsini a mbasa pe, so mu ulooso nde ku tsini a mbuu pe. Ka bunu, bali mu usuusu nde nha mbuu yanaanguuu; paa boosi ba bukoto bamono liyalila. <verse eid="LUK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>Ka a uli na iloo pe kibaswee, kikaahele umonuu, a uli na iloo pe kia tsweeyi kikaahele uyabina na umonuu nha kati a liyalila. <verse eid="LUK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>Ni mu buu, disa mayele mu nzuyili a beni. Mu ndaa ti, sa baha kwaa wa baa, ka kwaa wa heele ubaa sa bamupatila so ki nde atsimi ti mbayili a nde.»<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nguu na baana ba nguu ba Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mataayi 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Malako 3.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Nguu a Yiisu na baana banguu ba nde bayiri kwaa Nde; ka bakooni uswese kwaa nde mu ndaa a koongi yi inene. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Baata baleeli kwaa nde: «Nguu a we na baana ba nguu ba we bali ku mbari, batooni umono we.» <verse eid="LUK 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Ka Yiisu avutili kwaa bo: «Nguu a me na baana ba nguu ba me, ni babubaayuu mandaa ma Nziaambi na usalila mo.»<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu awurisi iteembi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mataayi 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Malako 4.35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Iluumbu imosi, Yiisu akoti mutso bootu na miyii mia nde. Aleeli kwaa bo: «disabuwani ku simi la diaanga lili mosi.» Na bayeni. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Mu taanga di baki sabuu, Yiisu alaari tolo. Iteembi kia mifuri kia abwi nha yula diaanga, bootu laluuli mu maamba, na bali bele na ufuu. <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Miyii mia Yiisu miaswesi kwaa nde, bamusiimbili na baloyi: «Muyiisi, Muyiisi, bisi dikwiiri.» Ka nde asiimbii, asieembi iteembi na mapo ma maamba biawuri, na bioosi biali na pii. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa miyii: «Imiini kia beni kuni yili?» Baluuli mu boomo na bakimii, baleelisini: «Ka wuunawu ni na, uli mutuumu kwaa iteembi na maamba? Na bio bili mu utumumu nde.»<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu abeelisi muutu ngaa miheebili mimibi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mataayi 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Malako 5.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Basiabii ku tsi a basi Ngerasa, yasuungunu na Ngalili. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Yiisu bu asutii nha simi, baala limosi lali na miheebili mimibi mu ngaanda yii, lamubwaani. Umata bele pee, lo lali bikutu ulwaata pe, mu nzo udiaala pe ka nde udiaala ku mangili. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Bu amoni Yiisu, aloyi, atsukini nha miili mia nde, na aleeli: «Yiisu, Mwaana a Nziaambi wa ku kati a yula? We ki ndaa li na yo na me? Kolokolo a we, a sieembe me pe!» <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Ka Yiisu atumi muheebili wumubi apala mu muutu wuu. Mundaa ti muheebili wuu akikwaamisa nde taanga dioosi. Bakikutu muutu wuu mio na miili mu mikuru mia bitali. Ka nde akitabulanga mio, na muheebili wu mubi aki biti nde mu matsi ma tsata. <verse eid="LUK 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Yiisu wamufuuli: «Kuumbu a we na?» Nde avutili: «Koongi»; mu ndaa ti miheebili mimibi mialaa miali miakoto mu nde. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Miheebili mii mia peli Yiisu anyaala utumu mio miyene ku mbeenge.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Ka nhaa, wali na mukaanga a bangulu wu munene baki dia ku yula a mulaanda. Miheebili mimibi mialoombi kwaa Yiisu aha mio muswa mu ukoto mu bangulu. Yiisu ahi mio muswa. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Miheebili mimibi miapali mu muutu, miakoti mu bangulu, mukaanga akilimini mu mbeenge a diaanga mu adiaami. <verse eid="LUK 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Bakebi ba biboori bii bu bamoni ma mayilimi, babati, babiti mamvuungu mu mangaanda na mu mala. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Baata bapali mu umono mioosi mialabii, bayiri kwaa Yiisu, bamoni muutu wapali miheebili mimibi adiaala nha pele a Yiisu, alwaata bikutu na ali na imuutu kia nde kioosi. Baata babayi boomo. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Babamoni miayilimi baleeli kwaa bamosi buni muutu ngaa miheebili mimibi akuulii. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Basi Ngerasa boosi baloombi Yiisu ayene, asiisi bo bu bali na boomo balaa. Yiisu akoti mu bootu, avutii. <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Baala lapala miheebili mimibi aloombi kwaa Yiisu anyaala nde aba na nde, ka Yiisu avutili nde, aleeli: <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>«Vutuu ku nzo a we, leele moosi ma Nziaambi ayilii mu we.» Nde ayeni na ayaabisi mu ngaanda yoosi, moosi mamuyilii Yiisu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwaana a Yayiro wa mukaasa na mukaasa wabeembe tsaanda a Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mataayi 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Malako 5.21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Bu Yiisu avutii, koongi a baata yamuyaki mbii bu boosi bakikebe nde. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Mono baala, la kuumbu Yayiro, ni mukuutu a nzo a makutunu ma Bayuudayo, ayiri ubwa nha miili mia Yiisu, wamupeli akoto mu nzo a nde. <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>Mu ndaa ti nde ali na mwaana wa mukaasa ndila mosi wa bilimi kuumi na bioolo wali nha peembi a likwa. Bu Yiisu akiyene ku nzo a Yayiro, makoongi mamupinyi kwalaa. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Mwali nhaa na mukaasa ngaa ibeeri kia upala makila umata bilimi kuumi na bioolo, na nde amani mbayili a nde yoosi ya paamba kwaa babuyi. Ka so mosi a atuuyi nde ubeelese pe. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Mukaasa me ayiri ku mbisi a Yiisu, abeembi ndeengi a mulwaata a nde. Nhaa-na-tsi, ibeeri kia nde kia palili a makila uyaaba uwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Yiisu afuuli: «Na beembi me?» Boosi bu batuni, Peetero aleeli: «Muyiisi, makoongi ma madiengelele we mali mu upinyi we kwalaa.» <verse eid="LUK 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Ka Yiisu aleeli: «Muutu beembi me, ka nziaabi ti mifuri mipali mu me.» <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Mukaasa bu amoni ti bamusolili, ayiri atehete, atsukini nha kulu a Yiisu ni aleeli nha kulu a baata boosi toono yi nde abeembi Yiisu na mbii bu abeelii nhaa-na-tsi. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa nde: «Mwaana a me, imiini kia we ivuuyisi we. Yene mu iyeenge.» <verse eid="LUK 8:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Bu Yiisu ali kene mu utsuu, muutu amati ku nzo a mukuutu a nzo a makutunu a Bayuudayo na aleeli kwaa nde wuu: «Mwaana a we wa mukaasa maakwa, a bwakwaamisa Muyiisi pe.» <verse eid="LUK 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Ka Yiisu bu ayuyi maa, aleeli kwaa Yayiro: «A ba na boomo pe. Sa ndila imiini, nde sa avuu.» <verse eid="LUK 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Bu Yiisu atoori ku nzo a Yayiro, a anyaali muutu akoto na nde pe nha mbisi a ndila Peetero, Yowani, Yaki na taayi na nguu a mwaana. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Boosi bamulili, bakombiti matulu. Ka Yiisu aleeli: «A dilili pe, nde a akwa pe ka ala tolo.» <verse eid="LUK 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Baata basiebi Yiisu bu bayaabi ti mwaana amaakwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Ka Yiisu akaangi koo kia mwaana, aloyi, aleeli: «Mwaana a ngebe, temene!» <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Muwuumu a mwaana avutii, nhaa-na-tsi nde uyaaba utemene. Yiisu aloombi bamuha bia udia. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Babuti ba mwaana bakimii kwalaa, ka Yiisu wabalii a bayaleele ma mayilimi kwaa muutu so mosi pe.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Isala kia miyii kuumi na mioolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mataayi 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Malako 6.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Yiisu akukii miyii kuumi na mioolo na ahi bo mifuri na lituu la ubingisi miheebili mioosi mimibi na la ubeelese bibeeri. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Wabatsindii mu uyaabisa Ipfumu kia Nziaambi na ubeleese babeeri. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>Aleeli kwaa bo: «A dibiti iloo pe mu midieenge, so mupaanga pe, so kutu pe, so kia udia pe, so mboongo pe, so diba na bikutu bioolo pe. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Pasi nzo yidikoto, diba muu natee bu dimatuu. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>Pasi ba buhele uholo beni, dipala mu ngaanda yii, na dikubulu lifuundu la miili mia beni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwaa Bayuudayo, ukubulu lifuundu la miili mu ulaa ti beni ka isala pe na ba ngaa bula baa ma maa bisi ndaa imbwe ya Ipfumu kia Nziaambi. Beni di siisi bo na lifuundu la bo, ni iliimbi ti Nziaambi sa afeenge bo </char></note> mu imbaangi kia bubi ba bo.» <verse eid="LUK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Miyii miayeni, bayoyi mu pasi bula, bayaabisi ndaa yimbwe, babeelese babeeri mu mambuu moosi.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Matsimi ma Erode maviinzini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mataayi 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Malako 6.14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Erode mutini a Ngalili, ayuyi moosi makilabuu. A ayaabi pe ima afwaana utsimi mu ndaa ti ba bamosi baleeli, Yowani maasiimbuu mu babakwa, <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>ka babakimi ti Eliya maamonuu, ba bakimi ka ti mosi mu mibili mimikulu maasiimbuu mu babakwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Erode aleeli: «Yowani, me natumu bakese mutswe a nde, ka muutu wuu ni na ndi mu uyuu mandaa ma pili yi?» Na nde asiayi mu umono nde.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu adisili maku mataana ma makama ma babaala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mataayi 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Malako 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yowani 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Batumu bavutii, bamuleeli moosi ma bayilii. Nde atakii na bo, ayeni nha bele a ngaanda yi bubaata Betesayida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Baata bu bayaabi buu, bamuduki. Yiisu wabayaki na ayaabisi bo mu ndaa Ipfumu kia Nziaambi. Nde abeelisi ka ba bali na nzala ubeeluu. <verse eid="LUK 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Busi babaandii uyili, bakuumi na boolo baswesii, baleeli kwaa Yiisu: «Tsinduu koongi baata bayene mu misieenge na mala mamadiengelele mu usaa ilaari na bia udia, mu ndaa ti muunamu mu tsi ya tsata dili.» <verse eid="LUK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa bo: «Diabaha bia udia beni bame.» Bo bavutuli: «A dibayi bikimi pe, ka ndila mapa mataana na batswi boolo. We atoono ti diyene usuumbulu baata ba boosi bia udia?» <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Bo bali helape so maku mataana ma makama ma babaala (5 000). Ka Yiisu aleeli kwaa miyii mia nde: «Diabadiaasa mu makaba makaba maku mataana mataana (50).» <verse eid="LUK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Bayilii buu, batumi boosi badiaala. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Nde aholi mapa mataana na batswi boolo, atali ku yula, na asiemi bio. Nde abukili bio na ahi kwaa miyii paa bakaba kwaa koongi. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Baata boosi badi, bayutii. Babiti mapwooyi kuumi na moolo maluulu mu bitsuru biasiaali.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Peetero aleeli ti Yiisu ni Mesiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mataayi 16.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Malako 8.27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Iluumbu imosi Yiisu akikuundu na miyii mia nde nha mbuu yatakuu, nde wabafuuli: «Makoongi maleeli ti me ni na?» <verse eid="LUK 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Bo bavutuli: «Bana ti we Yowani Mubootii, ba bamosi ti Eliya. Babamosi ka ti we ni mosi mu mibili mimikulu maasiimbuu mu babakwa.» <verse eid="LUK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Nde afuuli kwaa bo: «aka beni ima dileeli, me na ndi?» Peetero avutili: «We ni Kristo wa Nziaambi!»<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ayaabisi likwa na tsimbili a nde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-24">Mataayi 16.20-24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-33">Malako 8.30-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Yiisu atumi bo, banyaala uleele ndaa yii kwaa muutu so mosi. <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Nde abwileele: «Mwaana a muutu afwaana umono pasi dialaa. Bakuutu ba baata, na banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi na bayiisi ba mikele sa batunu nde na sa bamudusu. Mu iluumbu kia bitata sa asiimbuu mu babakwa.»<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Buni diafwaana uduku Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:24-28">Mataayi 16.24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34-9:1">Malako 8.34—9.1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Nde aleeli kwaa boosi: «So muutu tooni uduku me, anyaala utsimi mu ndila ndeme, aholo kuruwa a nde pasi iluumbu, aduku me. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Ni mu buu watoono uyobolo muwuumu a nde, sa adiimbisi nde, ka wu udiimbisi muwuumu a nde mu ndaa me sa ayobolo nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Ki ndaanda muutu ubaa so nde bayi tsi yoosi, ka diimbisi muwuumu a nde na yeni ku fuuyili? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Ka pasi wu ukwa tsionyi mu me na mu mandaa ma me, Mwaana a muutu bu akaayira mu buzitu ba nde na ba Taayi na ba batumu ba ngira, sa akwa tsionyi mu nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Ngwanya me nadileeli: Babamosi ba bali nha a bukwa pe natee bumono ipfumu kia Nziaambi.»<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mubili Mooso na mubili Eliya bakitsuu na Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mataayi 17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Malako 9.2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Biluumbu hele pwoombo nha mbisi a nhaa bu amani mandaa maa uleele, Yiisu aholi Peetero, Yowani na Yaki, ahaati na bo nha yulu a mulaanda mu ukuundu. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Bu akikuundu, kiinzi kia nde yakitii, mulwaata a nde aheembii, angeyini. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Itsundu-a-tsundu bamoni babaala boolo bakimoo na nde. Ni Mooso na Eliya <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>bamonii mu buzitu ba Nziaambi, bakitsuu na Yiisu mu ndaa a nziendila nde yikaayilimi mu Yeruselemi. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Peetero na ba bali na nde balaari tolo la mifuri, ka bu basiimbii bamoni buzitu ba Yiisu na babaala boolo ba bali na nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Mu taanga di Mooso na Eliya bakikabuu na Yiisu. Peetero aleeli kwaa nde: «Muyiisi, bubwe kwaa bisi mu uba nha. Dituungu bituru bitata, imosi kia we, imosi kia Mooso, imoso kia Eliya.» Peetero a ayaabi ma aleeli pe. <verse eid="LUK 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Peetero bu akileele maa, ibala kiayiri, kiabafuyi. Miyii miabayi boomo bu bo bakoti kutso ibala. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Mu ibala mwamati muniingi waleeli: «Wuunawu ni mwaana a me wu me nasoolo, diyuu nde!» <verse eid="LUK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Bu muniingi ayuyini, bamoni Yiisu ndila nde bake. Bawuri; mu biluumbu bii a baleeli kwaa muutu pe ma bo bamoni.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu abeelisi mwaana wu muheebili wu mubi akikitisi baba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mataayi 17.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Malako 9.14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Mu iluumbu kiaduki, bu bakulumini ku tsuu a mulaanda, koongi yalaa yayiri mu ubwaana Yiisu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Kutso makoongi muutu aloyi, aleeli: «Muyiisi, kolokolo a we: mono mwaana a me wa baala, ni mwaana a me ndila mosi. <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Muheebili wumubi li mu ubaakaanga nde, nhaa-na-tsi nde mu uloo, nde li mu utuutuu mu mifuri na mafuri mubaapala nde mu munywa. Muheebili wuu ubaanyoongoso nde kwalaa na a ali mu unyaala nde pe. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Me ndoombiangi kwaa miyii mia we babingi muheebili wuu, ka bakoono.» <verse eid="LUK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Yiisu aleeli: «Aa kubu yimbi, yahele na imiini! Taanga kwe me kaabwaba na beni na usuku beni? Bee mwaana a we nha.» <verse eid="LUK 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Bu mwaana aki yiri asweese, muheebili wu mubi abwiisi nde nha tsi, na atutisi nde kwa mifuri. Ka Yiisu afeengi muheebili wumubi, abeelisi mwaana a ngebe, na avutili nde kwaa taayi a nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Boosi bakimii mu bunene ba Nziaambi.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yiisu abwiyaabisa likwa la nde</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mataayi 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Malako 9.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Boosi bu bakimii mu maa moosi ma asi, aleeli kwaa miyii mia nde:<verse eid="LUK 9:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>«Diyuu bubwe mandaa ma me nileele kwaa beni: Mwaana a muutu sa bayeelele nha mioo mia baata.» <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Ka miyii a miayaabi ndeelili yii pe, yo yali ya tsweeyi kwaa bo paa bo banyaala uyaaba mbiindili. Ka bali na boomo mu ufuulu Yiisu mbiindila mandaa maa?<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Na avulu mu bunene nha kati a bo?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mataayi 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Malako 9.33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Miyii miabaandii ufuulusunu paa bayaaba na avulu mu bunene nha kati bo? <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Yiisu ayaabi matsimi ma mitimi mia bo, aholi imwamwaana, asuusi kio nha peembi a nde, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>na aleeli kwaa bo: «Pasi wu uyaka mwaana wu mu kuumbu a me, yaki me makulu, na pasi wu uyaka me yaki ka wa tsinduu me. Ni mu buu wavulu bukee nha kati a beni boosi ni nde wavulu mu bunene.»<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pasi wu uhele uba na beni itaata nde ni wa beni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Malako 9.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Yowani aleeli: «Muyiisi, bisi diamono muutu wapalisi miheebili mimibi mu kuumbu a we; bisi diakeelii nde, mu ndaa ti nde ali mu kaba la bisi pe.» <verse eid="LUK 9:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Yiisu avutili kwaa nde: «A diamulii pe, ka pasi wu uhele uba na beni itaata nde ni wa beni.»<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ayeni ku Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Bu biluumbu biali ka bele bi Yiisu afwaana uhaata ku yula, nde aholi kesili ya mifuri ya uyene ku Yeruselemi. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Nde atsindii batumu ku kulu a nde. Bayeni, bakoti mu bula ba basi Samaria mu uyiluu mioosi miafwaana mu nzirili a nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Ka basi bula babisi nde uyaka mundaa ti akiyene ku Yeruselemi. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Miyii Yaki na Yowani bu bamoni buu, baleeli: «Pfumu, we atoono ti bisi ditumu mbaa yi isotu ku yula mu unyeengisi bo?» <verse eid="LUK 9:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Nde asieetii kwaa bo, wabasieembi. <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Na bayeni ku bula ba kimi.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba batoono Yiisu uduku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mataayi 8.19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Bu bali mu kuulu, muutu aleeli kwaa Yiisu: «Me niduku we pasi ku we uyene.» <verse eid="LUK 9:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa nde: «Mibaa mili na matari, banyunyi ba yula bali na bilaari bia bo, ka Mwaana a muutu a abayi nha usuusu mutswe a nde pe.» <verse eid="LUK 9:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Ka nde aleeli kwaa muutu mukimi: «Duku me.» Muutu wuu aleeli: «Pfumu, manyaala me yadii taayi a me.» <verse eid="LUK 9:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Yiisu wamuvutili: «Nyaala babakwa badii babakwa ba bo. Ka we, yene ya yaabisa Ipfumu kia Nziaambi.» <verse eid="LUK 9:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Muutu mukimi aleeli ka: «Pfumu, me niduku we, ka nyaala me kwa yaha mabweele kwaa basi nzo ba me.» <verse eid="LUK 9:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa nde: «Pasi muutu wakaanga tsieengi mu usala na li mu ubwatala ku mbisi, a afwaana pe mu ipfumu kia Nziaambi.»<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu atsinduu miyii maku tsaamba na mioolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Nha mbisi a maa, Pfumu asiooli miyii mikimi maku tsaamba na mioolo, wabatsindii boolo-boolo ku kulu a nde mu mangaanda moosi na mambuu moosi ma nde makulu akee uto. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Nde aleeli kwaa bo: «Tolili yili yalaa, ka basiali ba bakee, ni mu buu diloombo kwaa pfumu a tolili atsinduu basiali mu isala a nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Diyene, me naditsindii weti baana ba mameme nha kati a miminzi. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>A dibiti ipokolo kia mboongo pe, kutu pe, bikoori pe, na a dibii muutu mu kuulu pe. <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>Mu pasi nzo yi beni dikaakoto, dikwaleele: “Nyaala iyeenge iba mu nzo yi!” <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>So muu muli na muutu wa iyeenge, iyeenge kia beni sa iba nha yulu a nde, so a buu pe, kio sa ivutuu kwaa beni. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>Diba mu nzo yii, didia na dinywa bibuha beni, mu ndaa ti musiali afwaana ubaa futu a nde. A diyoo mu manzo-manzo pe. <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Mu pasi ngaanda yi beni dikoto yi baata buyaka beni, didia bioosi bi badisuusulu. <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>Dibeelese babeeri bali muu, dileele kwaa baata boosi: “Ipfumu kia Nziaambi ika bebele na beni.” <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Ka mu pasi ngaanda yi dikoto so a bayaki beni pe, diyene mu makooyi, dileele kwaa boosi: <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>“Bisi dili mu ukubulu so lifuundu la ngaanda a beni lanambiti mu miili mia bisi mu uvutulu beni lo, ka diyaaba ti Ipfumu kia Nziaambi ika bebele.” <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Me ndeeli kwaa beni ti mu iluumbu kia pfuundisi ngaanda yii sa yivulu Sodomo mu umono pasi.»<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mangaanda mamabisi usa imiini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mataayi 11.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>«Aa ngebe kwaa we, Korazini, aa ngebe kwaa we, Betesayida! Ka so bimaanga biayilimi kwaa beni biamonii mu Tiro na mu Sidoni, keni bele pe baata bakoto mu bukwiili, balwaata masaaka ma ngooto, badiaali nha lifuta na bakiingili mayele. <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Ni mu buu mu iluumbu kia pfuundisi pasi dia beni sa divulu mifuri na dia ku Tiro na ku Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>A we Kapernawumi, we siiri imiini ti we sa banaangila natee ku yula? Ngori, sa bakululu we natee ku tsi a babakwa.» <verse eid="LUK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>Yiisu abwileele kwaa miyii mia nde: «Pasi wu uyuu beni yuyi me, wu utunu beni tuni ka me, na wu tunu me tuni ka watsindii me.»<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvutii a maku tsaamba na mioolo ma miyii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Miyii maku tsaamba na mioolo miayiri avutuu mu kinyi, na baleeli: «Pfumu, so miheebili mimibi mili mu utumumu bisi mu kuumbu a we.» <verse eid="LUK 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa bo: «Me moniaangi Saatina siotii ku yula weti nzieri. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Diyuu, me nadiha lituu la udiaata nha yulu a bataari na bangeenge, na nha yula litu loosi la mutaata. A uli iloo so imosi ki isa beni bubi pe. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Ka a diyaanga mu yi pe, ti miheebili mimibi mili mu usiingili beni. Diyaanga bu makuumbu ma beni masonomo mu mayula.»<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ayaangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mataayi 11.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13.16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Mu dii na taanga dii, Yiisu aluuli mu kinyi mu Muheebili wa Ngira, aleeli: «Me tooni kwaa we Taata, Pfumu a yula na tsi, mundaa ti we asweeyi mandaa maa moosi kwaa bangaa mayele na buyeri, na amweesi mo kwaa bikenyi. Ee, Taata, ka we tooni buba weti buu. <verse eid="LUK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>Taayi a me ayeelili me bioosi. Muutu pe wayaaba na li Mwaana mbii a Taayi pe. Na muutu pe wayaaba Taayi mbii a Mwaana pe na wuu wu Mwaana atooni umweese nde.» <verse eid="LUK 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Tumake Yiisu asieetii kwaa miyii mia nde na aleeli kwaa bo nha peembi: «Kinyi kwaa misi mili mu umono ma beni dili mu umono. <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Ni mu buu me nadileeli: Mibili mialaa na mitini batooni umono ma beni dili mu umono, ka a bamoni mo pe, na uyuu ma diyuu beni, ka a bayuyi mo pe.»<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsaba ya musi Samaria ngaa ngebe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Mono, muyiisi a mikele atemini na aleeli kwaa Yiisu mu ukete nde: «Muyiisi, ima nafwaana usa paa me holo mukobo wa moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi?» <verse eid="LUK 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa nde: «Ima basonuu mu mikele? Buni weli mu utaanga?» <verse eid="LUK 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Mukuutu a mikele avutili, aleeli: «Toono Pfumu Nziaambi a we mu mutimi a we woosi, mu muwuumu a we woosi, mu mifuri mia we mioosi na mu matsimi ma we moosi. Tumake toono mbaayi a we weti we makulu.» <verse eid="LUK 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa nde: «We vutili bubwe. Sa buu na we sa baa moonyi.» <verse eid="LUK 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Ka nde atooni umweese ti nduru a nde yili yasuungunu, aleeli kwaa Yiisu: «Ka mbaayi a me ni na?» <verse eid="LUK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Yiisu avutili, aleeli: «Muutu akulini ku Yeriko umata mu Yeruselemi, biwulu biamukaangi, biamuteti, biamupatili bikutu bi ali alwaata na bioosi biali na nde, biamusiisi nha peembi a likwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Bwali ti nguu a ngaanga a Nziaambi mosi akulini mu kuulu yii, bu wamumoni, alabii nha peembi. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Pili mosi, mulevita mosi ka atoori nha mbuu yii, bu wamunoni, alabii nha peembi. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Ka musi Samaria mosi wakiyene ku midieenge, atoori nha li muutu wuu. Bu wamumoni, wamukwiili ngebe dialaa. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Asweesi kwaa nde, ayitili maari na viinyi mu maputu ma nde na akuti mo mu matsaanda tumake anaayi nde nha yulu a puundi a nde makulu, wamubiti ku nzo a bieenyi, wamubaasili. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Bukia ngwaali musi Samaria apalisi mikuti mioolo, ahi mio kwaa pfumu a nzo, aleeli: “Baasila nde bubwe, pasi kio ikimi ki we kaatsindi mu nde, me sa futu we kio bu me kaayiri avutuu.” <verse eid="LUK 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>Mu bo batata, na we tsimi li mbaayi a wubiwulu biakaangi?» <verse eid="LUK 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Mukuutu a mikele aleeli: «Ni wuu, wamukwiilili ngebe.» Yiisu aleeli kwaa nde: «Yene we ka sa pili mosi.»<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu mu nzo a Marte na Mari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Bu Yiisu ali mukuulu na miyii mia nde, akoti mu bula bu mosi. Mukaasa wa kuumbu Marte wamuyaki mu nzo a nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Marte ali na mwaana a nguu, kuumbu a nde Mari wadiaali nha miili mia Pfumu, na akiyuu mandaa ma nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Marte ali mutele-mutele mu ndaa bisala bia ulaamba. Ayiri kwaa Yiisu, aleeli: «Pfumu, a yili mu usa we pasi pe ti mwaana a nguu a me asiisi me bake me sa bisala bioosi? Wamuleele abaasila me.» <verse eid="LUK 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Pfumu avutili kwaa nde: «Marte, Marte, we li na matsimi ma mutele-mutele mu mandaa malaa. <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>Ka ndaa ndila imosi yili na mufunu; Mari siooli ibari ki ibwe ki bamuhele umaasila.»<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ayiisi kuundili kwaa miyii mia nde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mataayi 6.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Iluumbu imosi, Yiisu akikuundu nha mbuu mosi. Bu nde amani ukuundu, mosi mu muyii a nde aleeli kwaa nde: «Pfumu! Wadiyiisi ukuundu mbii bu Yowani ayiisi miyii mia nde.» <verse eid="LUK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">«Bu dibaakuundu, dileele mbii bu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">“Taayi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">nyaala kuumbu a we yiba ya Ngira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">nyaala Ipfumu kia we iyira,<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>wadiha bia udia bia bisi bia pasi iluumbu.<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Sa masumu ma bisi kolokolo, ka bisi ka dibaasa kolokolo kwaa ba bu baasa bisi bubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">a nyaala bisi dibwa mu mapuusu pe.”»<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Nde abwileele kwaa bo: «beni boosi na uli na mbaayi: na uyene kwaa nde mu kati a kati a butsuu, na uleele kwaa nde: “Mbaayi, soomboso me mapa matata, <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>ka mosi mu banduu ba me mati ku midieenge bu ayiri kwaa me, me a ndi na iloo pe kia uha nde.” <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Ka uli mu nzo vutili, na leeli: “Nyaala me bunyanga! Munywa a nzo ba maakwadibuu mu tsiafi, baana na me makulu diamaala, a nituu utemene pe mu uha we mo.” <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Me nadileeli, so nde atemini pe mu uha nde mo, mu ndaa bu ali mbaayi a nde, sa atemene mu uha bioosi bi mbaayi a nde ali na tsata, mu ndaa pungusu yi ali mu usa nde. <verse eid="LUK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>Ka me nadileeli: diloombo, sa badiha; disaa, beni sa disololo; dikomboto sa badidibili, <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>ka pasi wu uloombo, baheeri; wu usaa, solili; wu ukomboto, bamudibili. <verse eid="LUK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Ki taayi mu beni, so mwaana a nde so loombi tswi, nde wamuheeri taari? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Na so loombi bi, wamuhii ngeenge? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Ka beni badili baata bababi, diayaaba uha baana ba beni biloo bibibwe, kaambisa Taayi wuli ku yula, sa akoono uha Muheebili wa Ngira kwaa babuloombo?»<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu avutili kwaa ba bamuwungisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mataayi 12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22-27">Malako 3.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Iluumbu imosi, Yiisu abingi muheebili wu mubi wa kitiisi muutu baba. Bu muheebili wu mubi apali, baba latsuyi; makoongi ma mali nhaa makimii. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Ka ba bamosi mu bo baleeli: «Nde ubaabingi miheebili mimibi mu lituu la Belezebuli, uli mukuutu a miheebili mimibi!» <verse eid="LUK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Ba bakimi bamuketi, bamuloombi iliimbi ki imata ku yula. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Bu Yiisu ayaabi matsimi ma bo, wabaleeli: «Pasi ipfumu ki ikoto mu kabini, sa itsaamuu, manzo ma bo sa mabwa mana nha yulu a mana. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Beni dileeli ti, me nibaapalisa miheebili mimibi mu lituu la Belezebuli, pili mosi ti Saatina li mutaata a nde makulu. Ka buni ipfumu kia nde idiingi? <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>So nibaapalisa miheebili mimibi mu lituu la Belezebuli, ka baana ba beni mu ki lituu bali mu upalisa mio? Ni mu buu bo sa baba bafuundisi ba beni! <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Ngwanya mu lituu la Nziaambi me nibaapalisa miheebili mimibi. Bu li mu mweese ti Ipfumu ya Nziaambi kiamaato kwaa beni.»<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>«Muutu wa mifuri wuli na bidwaanini, bu ali mu ukebe nzo a nde, bia nde bioosi bili mu iholo. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Ka wavulu nde mifuri ayiri, sa wamubwiisi, tumake sa wamupatila bidwaanini bia nde bioosi bi aba mu usa imiini, na ukaba bioosi bi wamuholi. <verse eid="LUK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>Pasi wu uhele ba na me, abele me; wu uhele ukukuu na me, li mu utsara.»<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvutii a Muheebili wu mubi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mataayi 12.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>«Bu muheebili wumubi upala mu muutu, sa ayene mu mambuu ma tsata, mu uyoosaa mbuu ya puumini. Ka mbiiti nde a solili yo pe, nde sa aleele: “Me nivutuu ku nzo a me yinasiisi.” <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Bu ayiri a vutuu, moni nzo bakoombolo na bayiluu bubwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Tumi nde sa ayene mu usaa miheebili tsaamba mikimi miavulu nde mu buhaangi, mio sa mikoto na udiaalila mu nzo yii. Mapasi ma muutu wuu sa mavulu mifuri na ma tsiomi.»<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngo kinyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Yiisu bu amani mandaa maa uleele, mukaasa mutso koongi yii anaangili ndaa, aleeli kwaa nde: «Kinyi yili na moonyi wakibiti we, na mabeene makinywiisi we!» <verse eid="LUK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Ka Yiisu avutili aleeli: «Bu bwee beeri mu leele, kinyi yili na ba bubaayuu mandaa ma Nziaambi na usalila mo!»<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndoombili a iliimbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mataayi 12.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Makoongi bu madiengilili Yiisu, nde aleele kwaa bo: «Kubu yiinayi ni kubu yimbi. Bo basaa imaanga, ka a bubaa iloo pe, so a ndila iliimbi kia yilimi mu Yoona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Mbii bwali Yoona iliimbi kwaa basi Ninive, ni buu bukaaba Mwaana a muutu kwaa kubu yi. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Mu taanga dia pfuundisi, mutini wa mukaasa wa ku baanda sa atemene nha kulu a baata ba kubu yi na nde sa abwiisi bo. Ka nde amati mwasieele matsi mu uyuu buyeri ba Salomo. Mono nha uli na wa vulu Salomo! <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Mu taanga dia pfuundisi, basi Ninive sa batemene nha kulu a kubu yiinayi na sa babwiisi bo mu ndaa ti basi Ninive bakiingili mayele ma bo bu bayuyi nziisili a Yoona. Ka uli nhaa na nhana wavulu Yoona!»<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Liyalila la nyutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mataayi 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6.22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>«Muutu a utuu unamisa mwiindi na usuusu nde nha mbuu ya tsweeyi pe, so ku tsini a ipaayi pe. Ka bali mu usuusu mwiindi, nha yulu, paa ba bukoto mu nzo bamono liyalila. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Mwiindi a nyutu ni lisi la we. So lisi la we lili polo, nyutu a we yoosi yili mutso liyalila. Ka bu lisi libeeli, nyutu a we yoosi yili pimisi ka. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Ni mu buu kebe liyalila lili mu we, a liyakituu pimisi. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>So nyutu a we yoosi yili mu liyalila, na ibari so imosi a yili nha pimisi pe, yo yoosi sa iyaluu mbii bu mwiindi wu ubaayalisa we.»<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu afuundi Bafarisi na Bayiisi ba Mikele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mataayi 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Malako 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Yiisu bu ali kini mu utsuu, mosi mu bafarisi wamukuungi mu uyadia na nde, Yiisu akoti na adiaali nha meese. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Mufarisi akimii bu amoni Yiisu mu udia, kwahele ukwaswaa mioo. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Ka Pfumu aleeli kwaa nde: «Beni bafarisi, dibaatsieemese mbasa na ikoombo ku mbari, ka ku kati beni dialuulu mu musoyi na mimibi. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Beni biwulu! Nziaambi wayiluu mbari a biloo, a ni nde pe ka wayiluu kati a bio? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Dihaa bioosi bi bili mu kati kwaa bawele weti bungori na bioosi sa bitsieeme mu beni.»<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>«Aa! Ngebe kwaa beni Bafarisi! Ka beni dibaaha ikuku kia kuumi-kuumi mu nduungu a mbala, na nduungu, na bitiiti bioosi bi dibaadia. Ka diameengele mbweeyili na litoono la Nziaambi, bunu bii ni biafwaana mu usa, kwahele a udiimbili bini.»<verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>«Aa ngebe kwaa beni Bafarisi! Bu dibaatoono mambata ma matsiomi mu manzo ma makutunu, na diatoono uyaka mabwe ma likiinzi mu kulu a mbari.»<verse eid="LUK 11:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>«Aa ngebe kwaa beni, bu dili weti mangili ma mahele uyabana, baata bali mu udiaata nha yula a mo kwahele a uyaaba!» <verse eid="LUK 11:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Mosi mu bayiisi ba mikele aleeli kwaa nde: «Muyiisi, bu li mu uleele maa, uli mu umoonuu weti we li mu utuu bisi!»<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Ka Yiisu avutili aleeli: «Aa ngebe kwaa beni bayiisi ba mikele! Ka beni dili mu unaa mifuna mialeme mu ubiti nha yula baata, ka beni bameme a dibaabeembe mifunu mii muleembi a beni so mosi pe. <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Aa ngebe kwaa beni, ba dibaatuungu mangili ma mibili bu diayaaba ti ba taayi ba beni badusi mio! <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Ka beni dili mu umweese ti diasiingi biyiluu bia bataayi ba beni mundaa ti bo badusi mibili na beni dili mu ubaatuungu mangili ma mibili mii. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Ni mu buu, Nziaambi mu buyeri ba nde aleeli: “Me sa na batsinduu mibili na batumu. Sa badusu ba bakimi mu bo na ukwaamisa ba bamosi.” <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Ni mu buu, kubu yi, sa basieembe yo mu ndaa makila ma mibili mioosi mamatsiaamii umata mbaandila tsi, <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>umata mu makila ma Aabeli natee makila ma Zakaria wu badusi nha kati a diki la nzosili na mbuu ya ngira. Ka me nadileeli: kubu yi sa basieembe yo mu ma mabi maa moosi.»<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>«Aa ngebe kwaa beni bayiisi ba mikele! Bu diaholii tsiafi a nziaabili na beni bame a diakoto pe, na dili mu ubaakiki ba batoono ukoto.» <verse eid="LUK 11:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Ka, Yiisu bu apali mu nzo, bayiisi ba mikele na bafarisi ba mukwaamisi mu iteesi kia mifuri, na ufuulu nde ma nduru ma mupili na mupili. <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>Bamuketi paa babaa mu nde toono mu ma mupala mu munywa a nde!<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Dikele na bangaa peluu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mataayi 10.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Mu taanga dii, mafuundu ma baata makukini, madiaatisini. Yiisu akwiyaabisa kwaa miyii mia nde: «Disa mayele mu liviiri la bafarisi, ni peluu a bo. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>A uli na iloo kiasweeme pe ki buhele usololo, na kii kia tsweeyi ki ihele uyabina. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Ni mu buu, moosi ma dileele kutso pimisi, sa bayuu mu taanga dia liyalila. Ma moosi ma dileele mu mapfuundu, mu itsuru kia kati a nzo, sa mayabina nha kati a baata.»<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Na diafwaana ubatila boomo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mataayi 10.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>«Me nadileeli bambaayi ba me: a diba na boomo ba babubaadusu nyutu pe, ka nha mbisi a nhaa a bubwabaa yi bu tuu usa pe. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Ka me sa nadilaa wu beni diafwaana ubatila boomo. Dibata Nziaambi uli na lituu la udumunu beni ku diaanga la mbaa nha mbisi a udusu. Ee, me nadileeli, wu dibatila!»<verse eid="LUK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>«A bubaayaluu masiee mataana mu mikuti mioolo pe? Ka pasi lo, lili na ndaanda nha kulu a Nziaambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Ka naanga dia mitswe mia beni dioosi bataanga dio. A diba na boomo pe, beni diavuli masiee ma malayi ndaanda!»<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Usiingi na utunu Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mataayi 10.32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12.32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10.19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>«Me nadileeli: Pasi wu uta imbaangi mu me nha kulu a baata, Mwaana a muutu ka sa ata imbaangi mu nde nha kulu a batumu ba Nziaambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Ka pasi wu utunu me nha kulu a baata, Mwaana a muutu ka sa atunu nde nha kulu a batumu ba Nziaambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>Pasi wu uleele ma mabi mu Mwaana a muutu, sa bamusa kolokolo, ka pasi wu utuu Muheebili wa Ngira, a busiingi kolokolo a nde pe. <verse eid="LUK 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>Mu taanga di bubiti beni ku ma nzo ma makutunu ma Bayuudayo nha kulu a bafuundisi, so ba bali na litumu paa badifuundusu, a diba na maketi-keti pe mu ma diafwaana uvutulu, na ima diafwaana uleele. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Ka Muheebili wa Ngira sa wadiyiisi ma diafwaana uleele mu taanga dii.»<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsaba ya muutu wa isini kia iwulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Mosi mutso koongi aleeli kwaa Yiisu: «Muyiisi, leele kwaa mwaana a nguu a me akaba na me mukobo a bisi.» <verse eid="LUK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Ka Yiisu avutili kwaa nde: «Na abiaalisa me mu uba nzioonzi so mukabi a mbayili a beni?» <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Tumake aleeli kwaa bo boosi: «Diyele mu nzala ya ubaa kwa lutulu iteesi, ka idiingi kia muutu a kia tsikini mu mbayili a nde pe so nde li na busini balaa.» <verse eid="LUK 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Nde ati tsaba yi kwaa bo, aleeli: «Muutu mosi wa isini ali na matsiee mabuti mbutu dialaa. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Muutu wuu atsimi mu mutimi a nde, aleeli: “Bibaanga bi ndi na bio bi bikee, kuni nisuusu bi kukii biinabi?” <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Ka mono: “Bubwe mu utsara bibaanga bi naba na bio, na utuungu bia vulu bunene, tumake me kukuu biloo bioosi. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Ku mbisi me sa ndeele kwaa muwuumu a me: Muwuumu a me, we li na biloo bialaa bi kukii mu bilimi bialaa bikaayira, ki wuumu, dia, nywa, sa mukuungi.” <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Ka Nziaambi aleeli kwaa nde: “Aa ngaa buwulu! Butsuu ba we sa kwa. Ninha bioosi bi we kukii bia na bikaa ba?”» <verse eid="LUK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>Yiisu abwileele: «Ni buu bu li mu umonuu kwaa uli mu ukukuu busini ba ndeme, na uhele na busini nha misi mia Nziaambi.»<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Usa imiini mu Nziaambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mataayi 6.25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Yiisu abwileele kwaa miyii mia nde: «Ni mu buu me nadileeli: A dikwaamisa pe mitimi mia beni, mu bi dikaadia mu ndaa idiingi kia beni, so mu bi dikaalwaata mu manyutu ma beni. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Ka idiingi, kia vulu biloo bia udia, na nyutu ya vulu milwaata. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Ditala bikwaakwaa a bibaakunu so ukukuu pe, a bili na bisweeyili so bibaanga pe; Ka Nziaambi ubaa buungulu bio! Ka beni diavulu banyunyi kwalaa! <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Na mu beni, mu ndaa miniongo mia nde, utuu ubweese so iluumbu imosi mu idiingi kia nde? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>So dikooni ndaa yi kee, mu ima dili mu ukwaamosa mitimi mu mandaa ma kimi? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>Dimono buli mu ukulu bifulu bia matsiee, a bili mu usala pe, na a bibaatuungu pe; ka me nadileeli: So Salomo mu buzitu ba nde boosi a alwaati pe mbii imosi mu bifulu. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>So Nziaambi ubaalwaatisa bitiiti bia mu matsiee lolo, na nha ngwaali sa badumunu bio mbaa: buni nde ukoono uyiluu buu kwaa beni! Aa, beni baata ba ngaa imiini ki ikee! <verse eid="LUK 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>Ni mu bu, beni a diafwaana ukwaamisa mitimi mia beni pe, mu bi dikaadia so bia unwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Ni bangooyi ba tsi bafwaana usa weti buu, ka beni dili na taayi wayaaba manzaala ma beni moosi. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Disaa Ipfumu kia Nziaambi tumi nde sa adibweese bini bioosi bi dili na nzala a bio.»<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Busini mu mayula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mataayi 6.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>«Mwaa mukaanga aba na boomo pe! Ka litoono la Taayi a beni ni mu uhaa beni Ipfumu. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Diyaluu bi beni dili na bio, diha mboongo kwaa bawele, diyiluu bipokolo bia mboongo bi bihele ufuu. Dikukuu busini mu mayula ma Nziaambi, ku muyibi ukoono ubesene, na batsierere a butuu ubiiyisi bo pe. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Ka kuu kuli busini ba beni, ni kuu kukaaba mitimi mia beni ka.»<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsaba ya uba likanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>«Di yilimi, dikweete kobo mu maluungu ma beni na miindi mia beni miba mia nama. <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>Difwaanina na baata ba bali mu ukebe pfumu a bo. Bu nde umata ku mukuungi a makweele, akomboto nha munywa a nzo, bo sa badibili mu mawasa. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Kinyi kwaa basiali baa, ba bu pfumu a bo uyiri avutuu, wababaasi bali likanda. Ngwanya me nadileeli: Pfumu sa alwaata bikutu bia isala na sa wabaleele mu udiaala nha yulu a meese paa nde akaba bo bia udia. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>So nde toori mu tsutsu a tsiomi so mu tsutsu wa boolo na wababaasi likanda, kinyi kwaa bo! <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>Diyuu: so pfumu a nzo ayaaba taanga dikaayira muyibi, buni keni nde a unyaala pe muyibi abulu nzo a nde. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Beni ka diyilima, bu diahele uyaaba taanga di kaayira Mwaana a muutu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Musiali wa mayele na musiali wa iwulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mataayi 24.45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Peetero aleeli kwaa nde: «Pfumu, teeri tsaba yi, kwaa bisi kele so a buu pe kwaa baata boosi?»<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Pfumu avutili: «Ka na li musiali wu mubwe na wa mayele? Ni wu pfumu a nde akaabiaalisa ikuutu mu nzo a nde, paa adisili basiali ba bamosi mu taanga diafwaana. <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Kinyi kwaa na musiali wu pfumu a nde bu akaayiri avutuu, nde li kutso isala, mbii bu bamusiisili kio. <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Ngwanya me nadileeli: Pfumu, sa wamubiaalisa litumu mu bioosi bi ali na bio! <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Ka so musiali wuu leeli mu mutimi a nde: “Pfumu a me a ubaa pe uyiri, sa adiingi mu uyiri!” Na nde baandii mu utete basiali ba bamosi ba babaala na ba Bakaasa, na diri, nywiri, na koli mala. <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>Bu pfumu a musiali wuu akaayira mu iluumbu na taanga di musiali ahele uyaaba, pfumu sa wamubingi, na sa wamukitisi mbuu mosi na babahele a imiini. <verse eid="LUK 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>Ka musiali wayaaba litoono la pfumu a nde, na a yilii pe mbii buli litoono la pfumu, nde sa bamudusu kubu ndusili yalaa. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Ni mu buu, musiali wahele uyaaba litoono la pfumu a nde, ka yilii ma mabi, sa batete nde kwa ukee. Pasi wu bayi bialaa, sa bamuloombo ka kwalaa, pasi wu baha bia funu, sa baloombo kwaa nde ka biavululu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu Yiisu sa uba na kabini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mataayi 10.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>«Me nayiri mu dumunu mbaa nha tsi, na tooni beeri ti mbaa me, keni yi maa-na-ma! <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Me ndi na libootuu la uholo, ki pili a pasi mu me natee bu lo liyilimi! <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>A ditsimi pe ti me nayiri mu ubee iyeenge nha tsi. Me na dileeli: Ngori, mu me sa uba kabini. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Ni mu buu, umata lolo li, mu bataa bataana bali mu nzo mosi, sa bakabuu, batata kolo ya bo, boolo ka kolo ya bo: <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Taayi sa abaa mutaata kwaa mwaana wa baala, mwaana wa baala kwaa taayi nde. Nguu sa baa mutaata kwaa mwaana wa mukaasa, na mwaana wa mukaasa kwaa nguu nde. Nguu a mulumi sa aba mutaata a buko ba mukaasa, buko ba mukaasa ka sa abele nguu a mulumi a nde.»<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyaaba utaanga biliimbi bia taanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-3">Mataayi 16.1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Yiisu aleeli ka kwaa makoongi: «Bu dimono ibala, ikumi ku peembi yi yidiaama taanga, beni dileeli mu mawasa: “Mvulu sa anoo”, sa buba weti buu. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Ka bu mupepe wa ku baanda li mu ufuulu, beni dileeli: “Sa iba na kiaangila kia mifuri”, na sa buba weti buu. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Bangaa peluu, beni diayaaba usoboso biliimbi bia ku yulu na bia nha tsi buni dili kutso bundimbi na uhele uyaaba mu ki taanga dika?»<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Diyuhusunu na mitaata mia beni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mataayi 5.25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>«Mu ima, dili mu uhele uba na mbahila mu ibene bameme, mu uyiluu ma libweeye? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Ka buli mu uyene na mutaata a we ku nzo a pfuundisi, bubwe mu ukwayuhusunu bu dili na nde keni mu kula, paa nde anyaala uyeelele we nha kulu a nzioonzi. Tumake nzioonzi a ayeelele we pe kwaa masodaare makaadumunu we mu perese. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Me ndeeli kwaa we: Ti we a upala muu pe, so we a beli yamaa loosi pe, natee bu ufutu mukuti wa tsieelele.»<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Disobo ndiaatili a diyakwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Mu taanga dii, baata ba bamosi bayileele Yiisu, mia yilii Pilato bu atumi badusu basi Ngalili mu taanga di bo bakiha bungori ba diki kwaa Nziaambi. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Yiisu avutili kwaa bo: «Mu matsimi ma beni ti basi Ngalili baa bavulu baata boosi ba Ngalili mu masumu, paa bo bamono pasi dia pili yii? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Me nadileeli: Ngori, beni ka so a dikiingili mayele pe, beni boosi sa dikwa pili mosi na bo. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>So a buu pe, kuumi na pwoombo (18) la baata, ba babwiilili nzo Silowa bu bakwiri, mu matsimi ma beni ti bo bavulu baata boosi, bali mu udiaala mu Yeruselemi mu ma mabi? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Ngori, me nadileeli: ka so a dikiingili mayele pe, beni boosi sa difuu pili mosi na bo ka.»<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsaba ya muti wa mufiike wahele ubutu mbutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Nha yulu a maa, nde ati ka bo tsaba yi: «Muutu ali akunu muti wa mufiike mutso nguundu a nde ya viinyi; bu ayiri ku usaa mbutu mu nde ka a bayi dio pe. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Nde aleeli kwaa musiali a nguundu a viinyi: “Mono, bilimi bitata nibaayasaa mbutu mu muti wa mufiike wu, ka a nibaabaa dio pe. Kwaanga nde! Mu ima ali mu ubiiyisi tsieengi kwahele a ndaanda?” <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Musiali avutili, aleeli kwaa nde: “Pfumu, manyaala nde ilimi ki natee me maatipi toto diadiengelele nde na ulooso mboloso. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Paa hele sa abutu mbutu bilimi bi biyiri, so a buu pe, sa diamukwaanga.”»<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu abeelisi mukaasa ngaa ipii mu saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Mu iluumbu kia saba, Yiisu akiyiisi mu mosi mu manzo ma makutunu ma Bayuudayo. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Mono mwali muu na mukaasa ngaa ipii kia mungoongo wabaandina umata bilimi kuumi na pwoombo, mbii bu muheebili wu mubi akaangi nde, mu iteesi kia uhele usuungunu bubwe. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Yiisu bu wamumoni, wamuteeri mbila, aleeli kwaa nde: «Mukaasa, we maakuuluu mu ibeeri kia we.» <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Yiisu wamunayi mioo, nhaa-na-tsi nde uyaaba usuungunu, na abili Nziaambi. <verse eid="LUK 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Ka mukuutu a nzo a makutunu a Bayuudayo akoli kesi bu Yiisu abeelisi mu iluumbu kia saba. Na aleeli kwaa koongi: «Biluumbu bisamina biafwaana mu isala; beni diafwaana mu uyiri badibeelese mu bio, ka a mu iluumbu kia saba pe!» <verse eid="LUK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Pfumu avutili kwaa nde, aleeli: «Beni bangaa peluu! Muutu-muutu mu beni a ali mu unyangila ngoombo so puundi a nde nha idiilili ya nde mu saba pe, na ubiti iboori mu uyanywiisi kio pe? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Ka mukaasa wu, uli ka ni mwaana a Abraami, wu Saatina akutu bibolo umata kuumi na bilimi pwoombo, ka a bubwe pe mu unyangila nde mu mapaanga mu iluumbu kia saba?» <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Bu aleeli maa, mitaata mia nde mioosi miakwi tsionyi; koongi yoosi yali na kinyi, mu moosi ma buzitu ma nde ali ayilii.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsaba ya libutu la muti wa kuumbu mutarede</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mataayi 13.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Malako 4.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Yiisu aleeli: «Na ima Ipfumu kia Nziaambi kiafwaanina? Na ima me nituu ufwaanisa kio? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Kio yafwaanina na libutu la booyi li muutu akuni mu wooto la nde, bu lameni, lakulii, na la kitii muti, banyunyi ba yula batuungi manzo ma bo mu mapaki ma nde.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsaba ya liviiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mataayi 13.33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Yiisu abwileele: «Na ima nituu ufwaanisa Ipfumu kia Nziaambi? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Kio yafwaanina na lifunusu la mapa li mukaasa aholi, avuuti lo na iteesi ki ilayi kia fariini a mapa natee bioosi biamani ufunu.»<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Munywa a nzo wasweetene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mataayi 7.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Yiisu bu akitaba mangaanda na mala mu uyene ku Yeruselemi, nde akiyiisi kulu a kulu. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Muutu wamufuuli: «Pfumu iteesi kia ba buyobuu ki ikee ili?» Yiisu avutili, aleeli: <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>«Didwaana mu ukoto mu munywa wasweetene: ka me nadileeli, ba balayi sa basaa mu ukoto ka a butuu pe.»<verse eid="LUK 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>«Mu taanga di pfumu a nzo akaatemene, na ubiinduu munywa a nzo, beni ba diasaala ku mbari, sa diyakomboto nha munywa a nzo na uleele: “Pfumu, Pfumu, wadidibili.” Ka nde sa avutulu kwaa beni: “Me a nayaaba pe beni ba kuni!” <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Bunu beni sa diamuleele: “Bisi diadi na dianywi na we, we ayiisi mu makuulu ma mu mangaanda ma bisi.” <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>Nde sa abwaleele kwaa beni: “Me a nayaaba pe beni ba kuni dili. Dimatuu nha pele a me, beni ba dibaasa ma mabi!” <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>Beni sa dilili na ukweete mini, bu dikaamono Abraami na Isaki na Yaakobi na mibili mioosi mu ipfumu ya Nziaambi, ka beni sa ba bingi ku mbari! <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Baata sa bamata ku peembi ya ku yi pala taanga na ku yidiaama taanga, ya ku taanda na ya baanda, sa badiaala nha meese mu Ipfumu kia Nziaambi. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Ni mu buu, uli na ba batsieelele bakaaba batsiomi, na ba batsiomi bakaaba batsieelele.»<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu na Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mataayi 23.37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Mu taanga dii, bana mu bafarisi bayiri, baleeli kwaa Yiisu: «Pala, matuu mu ngaanda yi, mu ndaa ti Erode atoono we udusu.» <verse eid="LUK 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa bo: «Yenani dileele kwaa mubaa wuu: “Me ndi mu upalisa miheebili mimibi na ndi mu ubeelese babeeri mu lolo li, na nha ngwaali, ka mu iluumbu kia bitata me sa mana isala kia me.” <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Ka mu lolo li na nha ngwaali na munamosi, me nafwaana udukusu kuulu yi ndi mu uyene. Mu ndaa ti a uli na muswa pe ti mubili bamudusu mu ngaanda kimi na Yeruselemi.» <verse eid="LUK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>«Yeruselemi, Yeruselemi, we wu ubaadusu mibili na ubaadusu mu ma manya baa ba Nziaambi ubaatsinduu kwaa we! Bunu, taanga dialaa, me naba natoono ukukuu baana ba we, mbii bu tsutsu ubaafuu baana ba nde kutso mapapi ma nde, ka beni a diatooni pe! <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Monani, sa ba bwoongolo nzo a beni. Me nadileeli: Beni a dibwamono me so hoolo pe, natee taanga di beni dikaaleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 13:35">“Nyaala Nziaambi asieme wu uyira mu kuumbu a Pfumu!”»<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu abeelisi mubeeri mu iluumbu kia Saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Bwali mu saba, Yiisu akoti mu nzo a mukuutu mosi mu bafarisi mu uyadia. Ba bali muu, basieetili misi nha yula nde, bamuketi. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Mono muutu wali na ibeeri kia idaanda nyutu yoosi ayiri na atemini nha kulu a nde. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Yiisu afuuli, aleeli kwaa bayiisi ba mikele na bafarisi: «Uli na muswa mu ubeelese muutu mu saba, ooti Ngori?» <verse eid="LUK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Bo ba bawuri na pii. Yiisu akaangi mubeeri, wamubeelisi, na wa mu vutili kwa mati. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Tumake, aleeli kwaa bo: «Na mu beni mwaana so ngoombo a nde abwa mu idunu, ka afwaana pe mupalisi nde, mu iluumbu kia saba?» <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Ka bo bakooni uvutulu ndaa mu nduru yi.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsoolili a mbuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Yiisu ati tsaba kwaa baba kuungi, bu amoni bu bo bakisoolo mambuu ma tsiomi, mutsolili a ma mbuu ma matsiomi, aleeli kwaa bo: <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>«Bu bakuungi we kwaa muutu mu mukuungi a makweele, a diaala nha mbuu ya tsiomi pe. Ka helape batumusu muutu wavulu we mu buzitu. <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>Na watumusu beni baboolo, sa aleele we: “Siisi nde mbuu yii.” Ka we sa ba na tsionyi mu uyene ku mbuu yili ku mbisi. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Ka bu bakuungi we, holo mbuu yili ku mbisi, paa nde watumisi we bu akaayiri sa aleele kwaa we: “Nduu a me, swese ku kula na ya diaala nha mbuu ya zaangama.” Babadiaala na we nha meese sa baha we buzitu. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Ka nibuu, pasi wu unaanguu mu inde makulu sa bamukulula, ka pasi wu ukuluu mu inde makulu sa bamunaangila.» <verse eid="LUK 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Yiisu aleeli ka kwaa wamuti mbila: «Bu li mu uyiluu ndaamba, atumusu pe ba nduu so baana ba nguu a we, so basi nzo ba we, so bambaayi ba we babisini, mu ndaa bo sa ba vutulu we mamvutu. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Ka bu li mu uyiluu ndaamba, tumusu bawele, ba ngaa bifuumbu, ba bali na bitonzo, babakwa misi. <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>Kinyi sa yiba na we, mu ndaa ti bo a bubaa kibuvutulu we pe, ka Nziaambi sa avutulu we mamvutu mu tsimbilili a balibweeye mu babakwa.»<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsaba ya mukuungi a makweele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mataayi 22.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Muutu mosi mu ba batumisi, bu ayuyi maa, aleeli kwaa Yiisu: «Kinyi kwaa wukaadia mu Ipfumu kia Nziaambi!» <verse eid="LUK 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Ka Yiisu avutili kwaa nde: «Muutu alaambi ndaamba yi inene na atumisi baata balaa. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Mu taanga dia udia, nde atsindii booyi la nde mu ya leele kwaa ba batumusu: “Yirani mu ndaa ti ndaamba ya maayilimi.” <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Kasi boosi babaandii uloombo kolokolo. Wa tsiomi aleeli kwaa nde: “Tsuumbiangi tsiee, ndi na nzala a yo uyamono, sa me kolokolo.” <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Wu mumosi aleeli: “Me tsuumbiangi bangoombo kuumi, me nzeni ku ya kengese bo, Me loombi we mu usa me kolokolo.” <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Wu mumosi ka aleeli: “Me bu bukweelangi mukaasa, ni mu buu a nituu uyira pe.” <verse eid="LUK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>Musiali ayiri ahi mamvutu moosi kwaa pfumu a nde. Ka pfumu a nzo akoti mu kesi, na aleeli kwaa musiali a nde: “Pala na sa mawasa, yena saa mu makuulu ma manene na ma misoo ma mu kati a ngaanda, bee bawele, na bangaa bifuumbu na ba bakwa miisi na bangaa bitonzo.” <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Musiali aleeli: “Pfumu, bu maayilimi mbii bu we tumi, ka mbuu keni ya saalila.” <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Pfumu aleeli kwaa booyi: “Pala mu makuulu, na yene natee mu mala, pasi nde wu we umono, wababamuu mu uyiri kwa me, paa nzo a me yiluula.” <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Ka me nadileeli, ti a so mosi mu ba me naba na kuungu, ka biimba ndaamba a me.»<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Usiisi bioosi mu uduku Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mataayi 10.37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Makoongi ma vuuti kuulu na Yiisu. Nde bu asieetii, aleeli kwaa mo: <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>«So muutu uyiri kwaa me na heli ubele taayi a nde, na nguu a nde, na mukari a nde, na baana ba nde, na baana ba nguu ba nde ba babala na ba Bakaasa na paa idiingi kia nde makulu, a utuu uba muyii a me pe. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Pasi wu uhele ubiti kuruwa a nde na uduku me, a atuu uba muyii a me pe. <verse eid="LUK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>Ka na mu beni, bu atooni utuungu nzo a yungi, ukwadiaala pe mu utaanga tala mboongo na uyaaba mbiiti dio sa dikuu mu umana nzo? <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Helape, nha mbisi a utuungu ibwa, ka kooni umana, boosi babumono nde sa basa nde saa, na uleele: <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>“Muutu wu abaandii utuungu, ka akooni umana.”<verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>«Bumosi ka kwaa mutini wuli mu uyene ku udwaanisa mutini mukimi mudiingi, afwaana ukwadiaala mu utsimi, buni nde utuu ubiingi mu fuundu la masodaare li ali na lo, bu ayaabi ti mbaayi wuu na mafuundu moolo ma masodaare. <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>So nde moni ti nde a utuu pe ubiingi, nde keni na taanga dia utsinduu batumu na uloombo iyeenge kwaa mbaayi mutini bu akeni ku la. <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Pili mosi ka mu beni, pasi wu uhele usiisi bioosi bi abaa, a utuu uba muyii a me pe.»<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mungwa wahele a isie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mataayi 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Malako 9.50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>«Mungwa li iloo ki ibwe. Ka so mungwa ma hele isie, na ima bubaavutulu isie kii? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Bunu nde ka ndaanda pe, so mu toto so mu mboloso, bafwaana ubumu nde. Wuli na matswi ma uyuu, nyaala nde ayuu!»<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Tsaba ya limeme ladiimbili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mataayi 18.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Batoli a limaanda boosi na bangaa masumu bayiri asweese kwaa Yiisu mu uyuu nde. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Bafarisi na bayiisi ba mikele, banhunhinyi mu ndaa Yiisu, baleeli: «Wuunawu ubaayaka bangaa masumu na ubaadia na bo!» <verse eid="LUK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Ka Yiisu wabatiri tsaba yi, aleeli: <verse eid="LUK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>«Nha kati a beni, ki muutu uli na kama la mameme na diimbisi limosi mu mo, ka nde a usiisi maku wa na wa mu tsiee pe mu uyene usaa limeme ladiimbili natee bu usololo lo. <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Bu asolili lo, naangila lo nha bisaambuu bia nde na yaangi. <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>Bu atoori ku nzo a nde, kukii banduu ba nde na bambaayi bebele na leeli kwaa bo: “Yaangani na me, mu ndaa ti me maasololo limeme la me laba ladiimbili.” <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Ni buu me nadileeli: mu yula sa muvulu uba na kinyi yalaa bu so ndila mosi mu bangaa masumu ukiingili mayele. Ka a mu maku wa na wa pe a bangaa libweeye ba bahele na nzala a ukiingili mayele.»<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukaasa wasololo mukuti wadiimbili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>«So a buu pe, ki mukaasa uli na kuumi la mikuti mia tala na diimbisi mosi, nde a unamisa mwiindi pe na ukoombolo nzo mu usaa bubwe-bubwe, natee bu asololo mukuti wuu? <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Bu asolili mukuti wuu, sa ata banduu ba nde ba Bakaasa na bambaayi ba nde ba Bakaasa ba bebele mbila na uleele: “Yaangani na me, me maasololo mukuti a me wa tala waba wadiimbili!” <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Me nadileeli: Nibuu buli na kinyi nha kulu a batumu ba Nziaambi bu ngaa masumu mosi ali mu ukiingili mayele.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwaana wadiimbili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Yiisu abwileele: «Muutu ali na baana boolo ba babaala. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Wa ngebe aleeli kwaa taayi a nde: “Taata, ha me ikuku kia mukobo.” Taayi akabi busini ba nde kwaa baana bo baboolo. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Nha mbisi a taanga hoolo, mwaana wa ngebe akukii busini ba nde boosi na, ayeni ku tsi ya la. Kuu afuusi busini boosi mu makinyi ma tsi. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Bu amani usalila busini boosi, tsata ya mifuri yakoti mu tsi yii, nde ka akoti mu buwele. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Nde ayeni mu usaa isala kwaa muutu mosi mu basi tsi yii wamutsindii ku matsiee ma nde mu uliisili bangulu. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Nde ali na matsimi ma udia biloo bi bakiha bangulu, ka a bamuheri muswa pe mu udia dio. <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>Ka matsimi madiengilili nde, aleeli: “Basiali kwe mu nzo a taayi a me, bali na biloo bia matsaalisa, ka kuni me ndi mu ukwaa mu nzala! <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Me nafwaana uvutuu kwaa taayi a me na uleele kwaa nde: Taata, nasi masumu kwaa Nziaambi na nha kiinzi kia we. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>A nabwafwaana pe we bwata me mwaana a we. Kitisi me weti mosi mu basiali ba we.” <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Nde atemini na avutii kwaa taayi a nde.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">«Ka bu ali keni la na nzo, taayi a nde wamutalili, wamukwiilili ngebe, adumi tiini, wamubwiilili mu kiingi na wamunyumbiti. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Mwaana aleeli: “Taata, nasi masumu kwaa Nziaambi na nha kiinzi kia we, a nabwafwaana pe we bwata me mwaana a we.” <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Ka taayi aleeli kwaa basiali ba nde: “Mawasa-mawasa, dibee mulwaata wavulu mu bubwe, dilwaatisa nde nde, diamulwaatisa ka muluunga mu muleembi a nde na bikoori mu miili mia nde. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Dibee mukolo a ngoombo wa too, didusu nde, didiaanani na diyaangani. <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Mundaa ti mwaana a me wu beeri wa kwaa maasiimbuu; beeri adiimbili ka solii.” Na babaandii uyaanga.»<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>«Bu maa makiyilimi mwaana a nde wa mukuutu ali ku matsiee. Bu ayiri asweese nha nzo, ayuyi muniingi a ngoombi na makini. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Nde ati mosi mu mabooyi mbila, wa mufuuli: “Ki ndaa yili mu uyoo?” <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Musiali avutili kwaa nde: “Mukee a we maayiri avutuu, taayi we maadusu mukolo a ngoombo wa too, mu ndaa ti nde wamumoni keni moonyi.” <verse eid="LUK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>Mono, mwaana wuu akoli kesi, na a abwitoono ukoto pe mu nzo. Taayi apali na wamupeli. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Ka mwaana avutili, aleeli kwaa taayi a nde: “Mono, bilimi bialaa ndi mu ubaasalila we, kaala a natunu mikele mia we pe, ka we a ahi me so mwaana a taba pe paa me yaanga na banduu ba me. <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Ka mwaana a we wu, bu amati ku ufuhusu busini ba we itwaari na bapuupu, we wamudusili mukolo a ngoombo wa too!” <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Taayi aleeli kwaa nde: “Mwaana a me, we li na me taanga dioosi, bioosi bi ndi na bio bia we. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Ka diafwaana usa mukuungi na uyaanga mu ndaa ti mukee a we wu beeri maakwa maasiimbuu, nde aba adiimbili ka maasoluu!”»<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Mukebi a busini wa mayele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Yiisu aleeli ka kwaa miyii mia nde: «Muutu mosi wa isini ali na mukebi a busini ba nde. Baata bamuleeli: “mukebi a we li mu usa busini ba we pfunu.” <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>Mukuutu wuu ati mukebi a busini ba nde mbila na wamuleeli: “Ima me ndi mu uyuu mu we? Leele me buni we ubaakebe busini ba me, mu ndaa ti we a ubwaba mukebi a busini ba me pe.” <verse eid="LUK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Mukebi a busini atsimi kutso mutimi a nde: “Ima nisa, bu pfumu a me akaamaasa me mu kebili a busini ba nde? Me a ndi na mifuri pe mu usala matsiee, na ndi na tsionyi mu usa tsoo. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Me Nziaambi buni nisa paa baata bayaka me mu manzo ma bo, nha bakaamaasa me mu isala.” <verse eid="LUK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>Boosi ba bakoti mayaama kwaa pfumu a nde, nde wabatiri mbila mosi na mosi. Nde aleeli kwaa wa tsiomi: “yaama la kwe we akoti kwaa pfumu a me?” <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Ngaa yaama avutili: “minguungu kama mia maari ma olive.” Mukebi a busini aleeli kwaa nde: “holo mukaanda a we, diaala mawasa sonuu maku mataana.” <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Tumake nde aleeli kwaa waduku: “Ka, we yaama la kwe akoti?” Muutu wuu ni avutili: “Masaaka kama ma mbutu dia bele.” Mukebi a busini aleeli kwaa nde: “Holo mukaanda a we, sonuu maku pwoombo (80).” <verse eid="LUK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>Pfumu akimii mu nzilii a mukebi a busini wu mubi, mundaa ti nde asiali mu mayele. Ka, baata ba mu taanga di bavulu baana ba liyalila mayele.»<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muutu a utuu usalila Nziaambi na mboongo pe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Yiisu abwileele: «me nadileele: disalila busini bahele a libweeye mu ubaa banduu paa bu busini bukaawa, banduu baa sabadiyaka mu manzo ma bilimi na bilimi. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Wa hama mu bi bikee, ahama ka mu bi binene, wahele a libweeye mu bi bikee, ahele ka libweeye mu bi binene. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Ni mu buu, so diheli uhama mu busini bahele a libweeye, na kaasa ilimbisi mu beni mu uha beni busini ba ngwanya? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Na so dihele uhama mu bia bangani, na kaaha beni bia beni? <verse eid="LUK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>A uli na musiali pe wu utuu usalila bapfumu boolo. Ka nde sa abele wu mumosi na utoono wu mukimi, so a buu pe, nde sa ayukunu na wu mumosi na ubele wu mukimi. Beni a dituu usalila Nziaambi na mboongo pe.»<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mandaa maleeli Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mataayi 11.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Malako 10.11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Bafarisi ba bali batoono mboongo bu bayuyi mandaa maa moosi, basiiri Yiisu saa. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Ka Yiisu aleeli kwaa bo: «Beni dibaalaa nha kulu a baata ti beni ni bangaa libweeye, ka Nziaambi ayaaba mitimi mia beni, ka bili bianaangama nha misi mia baata, ni bi Nziaambi ali mu umono ingaanzi. <verse eid="LUK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>Mikele na mibili miadiingi natee mu taanga dia Yowani. Umatuu mu taanga dii, bali mu uyaabisa ndaa yimbwe ya Ipfumu kia Nziaambi, na pasi muutu li mu usa mifuri mu ukoto mu kio. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Bunu yavulu uleenge kwaa yulu na tsi mu ulabuu, ka isonii so imosi kiavulu bukee mu mikele a yilabuu pe. <verse eid="LUK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>Pasi wu ubisi mukari a nde na kweeli mukimi, nde soongi, na pasi wu ukweele mukaasa wu mulumi a nde abisi, nde soongi ka.»<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muutu wa isini na Laazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>Yiisu abwileele: «Mwali muutu wa isini wakilwaata matsaanda ma mabwe na ma tala, nde akisa mikuungi pasi iluumbu. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Ka kwali ka muwele mosi, kuumbu a nde Laazaro, wakiyala nha munywa a nzo a baala la isini, nde ali na maputu nyutu yoosi. <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>Nde ali na nzala a udia biakibwa nha tsini a meese ma isini. Ka bunu, bambwa bakiyaleete maputu ma nde. <verse eid="LUK 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>Muwele bu akwi, batumu ba Nziaambi bamubiti kwaa Abraami. Isini ka bu akwi, bamudii. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Ku tsi a babakwa, muutu wa isini bu akimono pasi, asiimbili miisi mia nde, amoni ku la, Abraami na Laazaro nha peembi a nde. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Nde aloyi: “Taata Abraami, kwiilili me ngebe, tsinduu Laazaro alooso toso a muleembi a nde mu maamba paa aboloso lilimi la me, ka ndi mu umono pasi dialaa kutso mbaa yi.” <verse eid="LUK 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>Ka Abraami wamuvutili: “Mwaana a me, libili moonyi ti we abaa busini nha we ali musii, ka Laazaro abayi mapasi. Mu taanga di, nhaa na nha bali mu uboondo nde, ka we li mu umono pasi. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Nha yulu a maa, nha kati a bisi a beni ili na mbeenge yi inene, paa babutoono umatuu kuni mu uyiri kwaa beni bakoono, na beni kuu dikoono uyira kwaa bisi kuni.” <verse eid="LUK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Isini aleeli: “Taata, ka me niloombo kwaa we mu utsinduu Laazaro ku nzo a taayi a me, <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>ka ndi na baana ba nguu bataana ba babaala. Ayata bo imbaangi bubwe, paa bo ka banyaala uyiri ku mbuu ya pasi yi.” <verse eid="LUK 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>Ka Abraami aleeli: “Bo bali na Mooso na mibili, bo bafwaana mu uyuu bo.” <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Isini aleeli: “Ngori taata Abraami, ka so muutu mosi wu mati ku tsi ya babakwa yeni kwaa bo, sabakiingili mayele.” <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Ka Abraami wamuvutili: “So a bayuyi Mooso na mibili pe, a butuu usa imiini pe, so muutu simbii mu babakwa.”»<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Masumu na kolokolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mataayi 18.6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Malako 9.42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa miyii mia nde: «Mabaka a mutuu uhele pe; ka ngebe kwaa wu ukubusu mo! <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Bubwe bakutulu muutu wuu manya li linene mu kiingi na bamudumunu mu mubu, usa nde buu yavulu bubwe mu ndaa ti a ayabwisi mu masumu so ndila mosi mu bangebe ba. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Diyele! So mwaana a nguu a we si masumu, wamusieembe, so nde kiingili mayele, wamusa kolokolo. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>So nde si masumu mbala tsaamba mu iluumbu, ka nde yiri kwaa we mbala tsaamba na nde leeli: “Me kiingili mayele”; Wamusa kolokolo.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Imiini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Batumu baleeli kwaa pfumu: «Bweese bisi imiini.» <verse eid="LUK 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Pfumu avutili: «So diali na imiini weti libutu la booyi, keni beni utuu uleele kwaa muti wu: Tapuu na yamene mu mubu; nde a keni utumumu beni.»<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiafwaana kwaa musiali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>«Mu beni boosi na li na musiali wu ubaasala matsiee so wu ubaakebe biboori, bu nde umata ku matsiee sa aleele kwaa nde: “Yoo mawasa diaala nha meese.” <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Ka nde sa aleele kwaa musiali a nde: “Laamba me bi nidia, sobo bikutu suusu me biloo me ndia na me nywa. Tumake we ka sa dia na unywa.” <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Ka nde a ali na tsata a uvutulu matoondo kwaa musiali bu ayilii mi nde wamutumi pe! <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Pili mosi, beni ka, bu diyiluu moosi ma batumu beni, dileele: Bisi ni basiali bahele a ndutu: “dimaayiluu mi diafwaana uyiluu.”»<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu abeelisi bangaa bwaari kuumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Bu Yiisu ali ayene ku Yeruselemi, nde alabii nha kati a Samaria na Ngalili. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Bu nde akoti ku bula bu mosi, kuumi la babaala bangaa bwaari bamubwaani, bo batemini nha lala. <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>Baloyi, baleeli: «Yiisu, muyiisi, kwiilili bisi ngebe!» <verse eid="LUK 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Bu nde amoni bo, aleeli: «Yenani diyamonuu kwaa bangaanga ba Nziaambi.» Bu bakiyene, bo babeelii. <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Ka ndila mosi mu bo bu amoni ti nde maabeeluu, avutii, akiinzi Nziaambi mu ndaa yinene; <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>nde atsukini busu mu tsi nha miili mia Yiisu, na avutili matoondo kwaa nde. Nde ali musi Samaria. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Yiisu aleeli: «Bo a kuumi pe babeeluu? Ka ba wa kuni bali? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Wo! Ndili a mweenyi wu yiri avutuu mu uvutulu matoondo kwaa Nziaambi?» <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Tumake, Yiisu aleeli kwaa nde: «temene yene; imiini kia we ivuuyisi we.»<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Buni Ipfumu kia Nziaambi ikaayira</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mataayi 24.23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Bafarisi bafuuli Yiisu mu uyaaba ki taanga Ipfumu kia Nziaambi yikaayira, nde avutili kwaa bo: «Ipfumu kia Nziaambi a ili mu uyiri weti iloo ki dimono mu misi pe. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>A buleele pe: “Kio nha ili”, so “Kio kunaa ili!” Ka mono Ipfumu kia Nziaambi yili nha kati a beni.»<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Nde aleeli kwaa miyii: «Taanga dikaayira beni sadiba na nzala a umono Mwaana a muutu so mu ndila iluumbu imosi, ka a dimono nde pe. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Sa baleele kwaa beni: “Nde kunaa ali!” so “nde nha ali!” A diyene kuu pe, a didumu matiini kuu pe. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Ka mbii bu nzieri ubaasiereme mu uyalisa yulu loosi, ni buu, bukaaba Mwaana a muutu mu iluumbu kia nde. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Ka nde afwaana ukwamono pasi dialaa na sa babisi nde kwaa baata ba kubu yi. <verse eid="LUK 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>Miayilimi mu taanga dia Nowa, sa miyilimi ka mu biluumbu bia Mwaana a muutu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Baata bakidia na unywa, Bakaasa na babaala bakikweele na bakikweelise natee mu iluumbu kia koti Nowa mu nzaasa, nyaamba a maamba yayiri, yafuusi bioosi. <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>Sa iba mbii bwali mu taanga dia Loti: Baata bakidia, bakinywa, bakisuumbu, bakiyaluu, bakikunu, bakituungu; <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>ka mu iluumbi kiapali Loti mu Sodomo mbaa na mamanya ma mbaa bianoyi, biafuusi boosi. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Ni buu bukaaba mu iluumbu kikaamonuu mwaana a muutu. <verse eid="LUK 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>Mu iluumbu kii, wukaaba ku yulu a siaangi a nyaala usutuu mu uyaholo bisii bia nde mu nzo. Na wu kaba ku matsiee anyaala uvutuu ku nzo. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Dilibili moonyi mu mukari a Loti. <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Wu usaa uvuusu idiingi kia nde, sa adiimbisi kio, na wu udiimbisi idiingi kia nde, sa avuusu kio. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Me nadileele: Butsuu baa, mu baata boolo ba bala nha yulu a mbuu mosi, mosi sa baholo, na sa basiisi wunu. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Mu Bakaasa boolo ba bunyii mayaa nha mbuu mosi, mosi sa baholo, wu mumosi sa basiisi. <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>Mu Babaala boolo ba busala nha tsiee mosi, mosi sa baholo, wu mumosi sa basiisi.» <verse eid="LUK 17:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Miyii miafuulu kwaa nde: «Pfumu, kuni maa makaayilimi?» Nde aleeli kwaa bo: «Ku kukaaba mvuumbi, ni kuu ku kaakukunu mileri.»<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Tsaba ya mukwiili na mufuundisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Yiisu ati bo tsaba, mu umweese ti bo bobafwaana ukuundu taanga dioosi, na uhele ukoono. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>Nde aleeli: «Mu ngaanda mosi mwali na mufuundisi wali a hele ubatili Nziaambi boomo, na muutu ukiinzi pe. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Mwali na mukwiili ka mu ngaanda yii wakiyaleele kwaa nde: “biingisi me nha kulu a mutaata a me.”<verse eid="LUK 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>«Mu taanga dialaa mufuundisi a atooni pe. Ka nde aleeli ku kutso mutimi a nde: “Me nayaaba ti me ndi Nziaambi boomo ubatila pe na muutu ukiinzi pe. <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>Ka, mundaa ti mukwiili wu li ukwaamisa me, me sa biingisi nde, paa nde anyaala uyakoloso me mutswe nha na ukwaamisa me.”<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>«Pfumu abwileele: Diyuu maleeli mufuundisi wa hele a libweeye. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Ka Nziaambi a abiingisi pe baba nde ba asoolo bali mu uloo kwaa nde nyanga na butsuu? Nde sa adiingi mu uyabaasila bo? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Me ni leele kwaa beni: Nde sa abiingisi bo mawasa. Ka Mwaana a muutu bu akaayira, sa asololo ba ngaa imiini nha tsi?»<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsaba ya mufarisi na mutoli a limaanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Yiisu abwita tsaba yi kwaa baata ba bakitsimi ti bo ni balibweeye, na bakikeembele ba bamosi: <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>«Baata boolo bayeni ku nzo a Nziaambi mu ukuundu, mosi ali mufarisi, na wu mukimi ali mutoli a limaanda. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>Mufarisi atemini, akuundi kutso mutimi a nde: “O Nziaambi a me, me nitoono kwaa we mu ndaa ti me a ndi weti baata ba bamosi pe, bo ni bataani, bahele a libweeye, basoongi. Na a ndi pe ka weti mutoli a limaanda wu. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Me nibaadii mutuutu mbala dioolo mu limiingi, nibaaha ikuku kia kuumi-kuumi mu bioosi bi nibaabaa.” <verse eid="LUK 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>Ka mutoli a limaanda atemini ku la, a atuuyi so usiimbili miisi ku yula pe, ka anaayi mioo nha butulu ba nde, aleeli: Nziaambi, kwiilili me ngebe, me ni ngaa masumu. <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>Me nadileeli: Mutoli a limaanda bu uyene ku nzo a nde, amaakwamonuu walibweeye nha kulu a Nziaambi, ka a Mufarisi wu pe. Mundaa ti, wu ubaanaanguu, sa bakululu nde, ka wu ukuluu, sa banaangila nde.»<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu na bibabaana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mataayi 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Malako 10.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Baata babeyi baana ba bikenyi kwaa Yiisu paa nde anaa bo mioo, miyii mia nde bu miamoni buu, miasieembi bo. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Ka Yiisu ati bo mbila, aleeli: «Dinyaala bibabaana biyiri kwaa me, a dilii bo pe, mu ndaa ti Ipfumu kia Nziaambi ni kia ba bali weti bo. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Ya ngwanya, me nadileele: Pasi wu uhele uyaka Ipfumu kia Nziaambi weti imwamwaana, a akoto kio so hoolo pe.»<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu na muutu wa isini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mataayi 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Malako 10.17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Mukuutu mosi afuuli Yiisu: «Muyiisi wu mubwe, ima me nafwaana usa paa me tolo mukobo wa moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi?» <verse eid="LUK 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa nde: «Mu ima we li mu uta me “wu mubwe”? A uli na muutu wu mubwe pe, umaasa ndila Nziaambi. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>We ayaaba mikele: A soongo pe, a dusu pe, a yibi pe, a ta imbaangi kia pia mu muutu pe, kiinzi taayi a we na nguu a we.» <verse eid="LUK 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Nde avutili: «Mikele mii mioosi ndi mu uduku mio umata bufuru ba me.» <verse eid="LUK 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Yiisu bu ayuyi nde, aleeli kwaa nde: «Iloo imosi ikimi ili mu uhele we. Yaluu bioosi bi we li na bio, kaba bio kwaa bawele, na we sa baa busini mu mayula. Nha mbisi yiri na duku me.» <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Ka bu muutu wu ayuyi buu, nde abayi ngebe dialaa mu ndaa ti nde ali ngo isini. <verse eid="LUK 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Yiisu bu amoni ti nde ali na ngebe, aleeli: «pasi dialaa kwaa ba bali na busini mu ukoto mu Ipfumu kia Nziaambi! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Uli na pasi kwaa puundi wuli na kuuki mu uyoo mu wuru la tsioongi yibubaaloondo matsaanda, ka yabwavulu pasi kwaa isini mu ukoto mu Ipfumu kia Nziaambi.» <verse eid="LUK 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Ba baliayuu nde baleeli: «Ka, na utuu uvuu?» <verse eid="LUK 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Yiisu avutili: «Mandaa ma baata bukoono, Nziaambi mo ukoono pe.» <verse eid="LUK 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Peetero aleeli: «Mono, bisi diasiisi bidiali na bio mu uduku we.» <verse eid="LUK 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Nde aleeli kwaa bo: «Ngwanya, me nadileeli, mbii ti muutu siisi nzo nde, so mukari a nde, so baana ba nguu ba nde, so bibuti bia nde, so baana ba nde mu ndaa Ipfumu kia Nziaambi, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>nde sa ayaka kwavululu mu taanga di. Na nde sa ayaka moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi mu taanga dikaayiri.»<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu abwiyaabisa likwa na tsimbilili a nde mu babakwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mataayi 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Malako 10.32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Yiisu atakii na miyii mia nde kuumi na mioolo nha peembi, aleeli kwaa bo: «Diyuu, ku Yeruselemi diyenani, moosi masonii mibili mu Mwaana a muutu sa mayilimi. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Mundaa ti sa bayeelele nde kwaa bangooyi; sa basa nde saa, na utuu nde, na utswiili nde mate; <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Na bu bumana nde utete bo sa badusu nde. Ka iluumbu kia bitata, nde sa asiimbuu mu babakwa.» <verse eid="LUK 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Ka miyii mia nde a miayaabi ndaa so mosi mu mandaa maa pe; tsuyili yii yali yasweeme kwaa bo. A bayaabi tsutulu a mandaa ma Yiisu aleeli pe.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu abeelisi muutu wakwa miisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mataayi 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Malako 10.46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Bu Yiisu akibesine na Yeriko, muutu wakwa miisi adiaali nha mukoo a kuulu, mu ubaaloombo libaasili. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Nde ayuyi koongi yakilabuu, afuuli: «Kii ima?» <verse eid="LUK 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Bamuyaabisi: «Yiisu, musi Nazareti, li mu uyoo.» <verse eid="LUK 18:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Ni mu buu nde aloyi: «Yiisu, Mwaana a Daavidi, kwiilili me ngebe.» <verse eid="LUK 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Ba batswaamini ku kulu a nde bamusieembi paa nde awuru, ka nde akibwaloo mu mifuri: «Mwaana a Daavidi, kwiilili me ngebe.» <verse eid="LUK 18:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Yiisu atsikini, atumi ti dibee nde kwaa nde. Bu nde ayiri asweese, Yiisu afuuli nde: <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>«Ima we atoono me sa mu we?» Nde avutili: «Pfumu, me tooni ubwamono.» <verse eid="LUK 18:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa nde: «Bwamono wa we. Imiini kia we ivuuyisi we!» <verse eid="LUK 18:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Nhaa-na-tsi nde abwibaanduu umono, na nde aduki Yiisu, abili Nziaambi. Baata boosi bu bamoni buu, bakiinzi Nziaambi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu na Zakaayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Yiisu akoti ku Yeriko, na nde atabi ngaanda. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Ali na baala li mosi kuumbu Zakaayi. Nde ali mukuutu a batoli balimaanda, nde ali isini. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Nde akisaa umono, Yiisu ni na, ka nde akooni mu ndaa a koongi, na nde ali mukusi. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Adumi tiini ku kulu, ahaati mu muti wa kuumbu sikomore paa amono Yiisu nha nde uyoo mu kuulu yii. <verse eid="LUK 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Yiisu bu atoori nha mbuu yii, asiimbili misi, aleeli kwaa nde: «Zakaayi, sutuu mawasa, me na nafwaana ubaa mbuu mu nzo a we lolo.» <verse eid="LUK 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Mu kinyi yoosi, Zakaayi asutii mawasa mu uyaka nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Bu bamoni buu, bo boosi banhunhinyi, baleeli: «Nde maayakoto mu nzo a ngaa masumu!» <verse eid="LUK 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Zakaayi atemini, aleeli kwaa Nde: «Pfumu, mono, ibari kia busini ba me niha kwaa bawele, mbii ti me napatili wosi isii kwaa muutu, me sa vutulu nde kio mbala na.» <verse eid="LUK 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa nde: «lolo liyobolo limaakoto mu nzo yi, mundaa ti weka mwaana a Abraami. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Mu ndaa, Mwaana a muutu ayiri mu usaa na uyobolo ba badiimbili.»<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsaba ya mikuti mia woolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mataayi 25.14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Bu bayuyi buu, Yiisu abwita tsaba kimi, mundaa ti nde ali bele na Yeruselemi, na baliatsimi ti Ipfumu kia Nziaambi sa imonuu nhaa-na-tsi. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Nde aleeli mbii bu: «Muutu wa nzo ya likiinzi ayeni ku tsi ya la, ku uholo ipfumu na uyiri avutuu. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Nde ati basiali ba nde kuumi mbila, ahi bo mukuti kuumi mia woolo, na wabaleeli: “Dita kaari natee bu me niyiri avutuu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Ka baata ba ku tsi a nde bakibele nde, batsindii batumu nha mbisi a nde uyaabisa: “A diatoono muutu wu aba mutini a bisi pe.” <verse eid="LUK 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>Nha mbisi a ubiaalisa nde mu uba mutini, nde avutii, atumi, bata basiali ba nde mbila, ba nde ahi mikuti mia woolo, mu uyaaba ki ndaanda bo bamaabaa. <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Wa tsiomi ayiri, aleeli: “Pfumu, me mbayi ndaanda a mikuti mia woolo kuumi nha yulu a mukutu a woolo a we.” <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Pfumu wamuleeli: “Ngo bubwe, we musiali walibweeye, bu we hami mu biavulu bukee, me suusu we mukuutu a mangaanda kuumi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Wa boolo ayiri, aleeli: “Pfumu, me mbayi ndaanda a mikuti mitaana mia woolo nha yula a mukuti a we.” <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Pfumu aleeli kwaa wuu ka: “We ka, me suusi mukuutu a mangaanda mataana.” <verse eid="LUK 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>Musiali mukimi ayiri, aleeli: “Pfumu, mono mukuti a woolo a we, wu naswee kutso tsaanda. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Me aba na boomo ba we, bu we li muutu wa ibaala, ubaa holo ki we ahele usuusu, na ubaakukuu ki we ahele ukunu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>Pfumu aleeli kwaa nde: “musiali wu mubi, mu mi we maatsuu me kaafuundusu we. We aba ayaaba ti me ni muutu wa ibaala, nibaaholo ki nahele usuusu, nibaakukuu ki nahele ukunu. <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Mu ima we ahele usuusu mboongo dia me ku nzo a mboongo? Bu nziri, me keni uholo dio na ndaanda.” <verse eid="LUK 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>Na nde aleeli kwaa bali nhaa: “Dipatila nde mukuti a woolo, diha nde kwaa uli na mikuti mia woolo kuumi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Ka bo baleeli kwaa nde: “Pfumu, nde li na mikuti mia woolo kuumi!” <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>Me nadileeli: “Sa ba ha kwaa uli na iloo, ka kwaa hele a iloo, sa ba patila nde so ki ali na kio. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Ka kwaa mitaata mia me mia heli utoono ti me ba mutini a bo, dibee mio nha, dikese mio makiingi nha kulu a me.”»<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kotili a Yiisu ku Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mataayi 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Malako 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yowani 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Bu nde amani na utsuu, Yiisu atswaamini ku kulu a koongi, na ayeni ku Yeruselemi. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Bu nde abesine na Betefange na Betania nha peembi a mulaanda wu bubaata mulaanda a Olive, nde atsindii mioolo mu miyii mia nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>Aleeli: «Yenani ku bula ba nha kulu a beni; bu dikoto mu bo, sa disololo mwaana a puundi bakutu uli muutu keni a adiaala pe nha yulu a nde; dinyangila nde na dibee nde nha. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>So muutu fuuli beni: “Mu ima dinyangila nde?” Dileele kwaa nde: “Pfumu li na nzala a nde.”»<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Ba batsindii bayeni, na basolili mioosi mbii bu baleeli bo. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Bu bakinyingila mwaana a puundi ba ngaa nde baleeli kwaa bo: «Mu ima dili mu unyangila mwaana a puundi wu?» <verse eid="LUK 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Bo bavutuli: «Pfumu li na nzala a nde.» <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Bo babeyi nde kwaa Yiisu; basuusi bikutu bia bo nha yulu a mwaana a puundi, na banayi Yiisu nha yula. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Bu Yiisu akiyene, baata bakiyala bikutu bia bo mu kuulu. <verse eid="LUK 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Bu nde akibesine na Yeruselemi mu kuulu ya usutuu mulaanda a Olive, koongi a miyii miayaangi na miakiinzi Nziaambi mu ndaa yinene, mu bimaanga bi bo bamoni. <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>Baleeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">«Nziaambi asieme mutini uli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">mu uyiri mu kuumbu a Pfumu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">Iyeenge mu yula</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">na buzitu mu kati a mayula!»<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Babamosi mu bafarisi nha kati a koongi baleeli kwaa nde: «Muyiisi, sieembe miyii mia we mi wuru kele.» <verse eid="LUK 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Nde avutili kwaa bo: «Me na dileeli, so bo baa-na-ba bawuri, ni mamanya samaloo.»<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu alili mu ndaa Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Bu Yiisu atoori nha peembi ngaanda a Yeruselemi, amoni yo, alili mu ndaa yo, <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>aleeli: «So weka ali ayaaba mu lolo li buni we usololo iyeenge! Ka mu taanga di, kio imaasweeme kwaa we! <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Ka biluumbu bikaayira kwaa we, bili ti mitaata mia we, sa midiengelele we, sa midiaalila we na uswetese we mu mapeembi moosi. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Sa bakosolo we na baana ba we, na a busiisi manya nha yulu a manya mu we pe, mu ndaa ti we ayaabi taanga di Nziaambi ayiri mu ukuulu we pe.»<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu mu nzo a Nziaambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mataayi 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Malako 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yowani 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Yiisu akoti mu nzo a Nziaambi, abaandii ubingi bakiyaluu, <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>aleeli kwaa bo: «Basonuu: “Nzo a me sa yiba nzo a likuundu.” Ka beni dimaasa yo mbuu ya tsweeyi ya miyibi!» <verse eid="LUK 19:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Yiisu akiyiisi pasi iluumbu mu nzo a Nziaambi. Ka banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi, na bayiisi ba mikele, na bakuutu ba baata, basiayi udusu nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Ka bo a bayaabi pe buni bafwaana usa, mu ndaa ti baata boosi bakiduku nde mu uyuu mandaa ma nde.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Lituu la Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mataayi 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Malako 11.27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Iluumbu imosi nha kati a biluumbu bii, Yiisu akiyiisi baata mu nzo a Nziaambi na uyaabisa ndaa yimbwe. Banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi na bayiisi ba mikele, na bakuutu ba baata bayiri, <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>na ba leeli kwaa nde: «Leele bisi mu ki lituu we li musa mandaa ma! Na aha we lituu lii?» <verse eid="LUK 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Nde avutili, kwaa bo: «Me ka nifuulu beni nduru, vutulani me: <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>Lituu la ubootuu baata, na ahi lo kwaa Yowani? Nziaambi oo baata?» <verse eid="LUK 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Ka bo balelisini: «So divutili ti Nziaambi ahi nde lo, nde sa aleele: “mu ima beni diahele usa nde imiini?” <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>So divutili ti baata ba muhi nde lo, koongi yoosi sa yidusu bisi mu mamanya, mu ndaa ti boosi basi imiini ti Yowani ali mubili.» <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Ka bavutuli ti: «bisi a diayaaba pe na ahi nde lituu mu ubootuu.» <verse eid="LUK 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Ka Yiisu wabaleeli: «me ka a nileele beni pe mu ki lituu me ndi mu usa mandaa ma.»<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsaba ya basiali ba mu nguundu a viinyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mataayi 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Malako 12.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Tumake, Yiisu ati tsaba yi kwaa koongi: «Muutu mosi akuni nguundu a viinyi, asiisi yo nha mioo mia basiali ba viinyi, na ayeni ku midieenge mu taanga dialaa. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Taanga dia tolili bu diatoori, ngaa nguundu wuu atsindii musiali mosi kwaa basiali ba viinyi, paa baha nde ikuku kia mbutu dia viinyi. Ka basiali ba viinyi bamuteti na bamuvutili mioo na mioo. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Nde abwitsinduu musiali mukimi, bo bamuteti na bamutuyi, tumake bamuvutili mioo na mioo. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Nde abwitsinduu musiali wa mutata, bo bamunemisi na bamupalisi ku mbari a nguundu. <verse eid="LUK 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Ngaa nguundu a viinyi aleeli: “me buni nisa? Me sa tsinduu mwaana a me wa litoono, hele a pe sa bamukiinzi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Ka basiali ba viinyi bu bamumoni, balelisini: “Wuunawu ni mutoli a mukobo; diamudusu paa ti mukobo aba ka wa bisi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Na bo bamubingisi ku mbari a nguundu a viinyi, bamudusi. Buni ngaa nguundu a viinyi akaayiluu yiluu mu bo? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>Nde sa ayiri nde makulu, sa adusu basiali ba viinyi, na sa aha nguundu a viinyi kwaa bakimi.» Bu bayuyi mandaa maa, bakimii, baloyi: «Ngori a uba buu pe.» <verse eid="LUK 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Ka Yiisu wabatali isooso, na aleeli: «Tsutulu a mandaa mabasonuu ma, ma?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">“Ni manya li bameengili, limaakituu manya la ibwa.”<verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Pasi nde wu ubwa nha yulu a manya li, nde sa akosuu; na pasi wu lo libwiilili, lo sa likosolo nde.»<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Limaanda la Kayisari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mataayi 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Malako 12.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Bayiisi ba mikele na banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi basiayi mu ukaanga Yiisu mu taanga dii, ka babayi boomo ba baata. Bo bayaabi ti, mu ndaa bo nde ati tsaba yii.<verse eid="LUK 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Bamuketi, batsindii baata bafuti uba balibweeye, mu usaa toono yi butuu ukaanga nde mu mimipala mu munywa a nde, paa bamuyeelele kwaa ipfumu kia tsi na kwaa mutini. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Baata baa bamufuuli: «Muyiisi, diayaaba ti we ubaatsuu na ubaayiisi bubwe; we a li na ipengenge pe, ka we li mu uyiisi kuulu a Nziaambi mu ngwanya. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Ka leele a ti bisi, bisi dili na muswa wa ufutu limaanda kwaa Kayisari oo ngori?» <verse eid="LUK 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Ka Yiisu ayaabi ti mweete bamulebii, wabaleeli: «Dimweese me mukuti a mboongo mosi. <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>Kiinzi na kuumbu bili mu mukuti wu bia na bili?» Bo bavutuli: «Bia Kayisari.» <verse eid="LUK 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Ka Yiisu aleeli kwaa bo: «Divutulu kwaa Kayisari bia Kayisari na kwaa Nziaambi bia Nziaambi.» <verse eid="LUK 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Bo bakooni usololo toono mu ma akileele nha kulu a baata; Ka bo bakimii mu mvutu a nde, ba beeri na pii.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nduru mu tsimbilili mu babakwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mataayi 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Malako 12.18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Kaba la basaduki bakihamisa ti a muli na tsimbilili mu babakwa pe, bayiri mu ufuulu Yiisu: <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>«Muyiisi, mono bu Mooso wadisonii: “So muutu li na mwaana a nguu, kwiiri na siisi mukari kwa hele a mwaana, mwaana a nguu a nde afwaana ukweele mukwiili mu uha baana kwaa wakwi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Kwali baana ba nguu tsaamba. Wa tsiomi akweeli mukaasa, akwi na a abuti mwaana pe. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Wa boolo aholi mukwiili, <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>na wa mutata ka aholi mukwiili. Boosi ba yili buu natee wa tsaamba, bo bakwi kwa hele a usiisi baana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Nha tsieelele mukaasa ka akwi. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Mu iluumbu kia tsimbilili a babakwa, mukaasa wuu mukari a na akaaba? Mu ndaa ti bo tsaamba bamukweeli!» <verse eid="LUK 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa bo: «Nha tsini a toto nha, babaala na Bakaasa bali mu ukwelisine, na bali mu ukweelise. <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>Ka ba bakaamonuu ba balibweeye mu usiimbuu mu babakwa na ukoto mu tsi yii, a bukweele pe. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Bo a butuu ubwakwa pe; mu ndaa ti bo bafwaanina na batumu ba Nziaambi, na bali baana ba Nziaambi, bu busiimbuu mu babakwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Mooso ayaabisi ti babakwa sa basiimbuu, mii ni mia yaabisi Mooso mu ndaa a muti waluli mbaa, bu nde ati Pfumu “Nziaambi a Abraami, Nziaambi a Isaki, na Nziaambi a Yaakobi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Ka nde a ali pe Nziaambi a babakwa, ka nde Nziaambi a ba bali moonyi; ka mu nde boosi bali moonyi.» <verse eid="LUK 20:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Ba bamosi mu bayiisi ba mikele bavutuli: «Muyiisi, we tsuyi bubwe.» <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Na a babwituu ufuulu nde nduru so mosi pe.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo na Daavidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mataayi 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Malako 12.35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Yiisu wabaleeli: «Buni butuu uleele ti Kristo ni mwaana a Daavidi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/>Ka Daavidi nde makulu aleeli mu mukaanda wa Mikuunga: “Pfumu aleeli kwaa Pfumu a me: Diaala nha koo kia me kia babaala, <verse eid="LUK 20:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>natee bu me nisuusu mitaata mia we ku tsini a miili mia we.” <verse eid="LUK 20:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>Daavidi li mu uta nde Pfumu, ka buni nde utuu uba mwaana a nde?»<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu asieembi bayiisi ba mikele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mataayi 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Malako 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Bu baata boosi bakiyuu nde, Yiisu aleeli kwaa miyii mia nde: <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>«Disa mayele mu bayiisi ba mikele. Bo batoono udieenge mu miloopo mimila, batoono babii bo mu makooyi, na usoolo mambata matsiomi mu manzo ma makutunu ma Bayuudayo, na mu mikuungi. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Bo bali mu upatila biabaa bakwiili, na mu nzala a umonuu bo bubaasa makuundu mamala. Ka pfuundisi a bo sa yiba yavulu mifuri.»<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Mukwiili wa muwele ahi mikuti mia nde mioosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Malako 12.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Yiisu asiimbili miisi, amoni bisini biakilooso bungori ba bo mutso itungu kia bungori. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Nde amoni ka mukwiili wa muwele aloosi mwaana mikuti mioolo. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Ka nde aleeli: «Mu ngwanya me ni leeli kwa beni: Mukwiili wuunawu wa muwele ma haa kwa vulu boosi. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Ka ba boosi ba hii bungori mu mboongo diahele a tsala mu busini ba bo, ka wuunawu mu buwele ba nde hii bioosi bi ali na bio.»<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ayaabisi tsialili a nzo a Nziaambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mataayi 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Malako 13.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Bu ba bamosi bakitsuu mu ndaa nzo a Nziaambi, bo baleeli ti yo yali ngo bubwe na mamanya ma ba tungi yo, na bioosi bi bahi kwa Nziaambi biabweyisi yo. Yiisu aleeli: <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>«Bi beni dili mu umono bi, mu biluumbu bikaayira, a mu saala manya nha yulu a manya pe; bioosi sa ba tsala.»<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Biliimbi bikaayaabisa pasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mataayi 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Malako 13.3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Bamufuuli: «Muyiisi, ki taanga maa makaayira? Ki iliimbi ikaa mweese mandaa maa?» <verse eid="LUK 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Yiisu avutili: «Dikele, a bafutu beni, ka balaa bakaayiri mu kuumbu a me na uleele: “Me ni Mesiya!” na: “Taanga dika bebele!” a diduku bo pe. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Bu dikaayuu bali mu utsuu mu midiingi na punga-pungu a diba na boomo pe, ka maa mafwaana ukwato, ka keni a manini pe.» <verse eid="LUK 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Ka nde aleeli kwaa bo: «Ipfumu imosi sa idwaanisa ipfumu ikimi, na tsi mosi sa yidwaaanisa tsi kimi. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Toto sa diningini kwa mifuri, na mu mambuu malaa, sa muba bibeeri bia tsitsi na tsata; sa muba ka na mandaa ma tsitsi, na biliimbi bia kimikimi ku yula.»<verse eid="LUK 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Puusu iliimbi ki inene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>«Ka tswami a maa moosi, sa bakaanga beni, sa bakwaamisa beni, sa bayeelele beni mu ufuundusu mu manzo ma makutunu a Bayuudayo, na sa badumunu beni mu perese. Sa babiti beni nha kulu a bapfumu ba tsi na mitini mu ndaa kuumbu a me. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Maa moosi sa mabiti beni mu uta imbaangi mu me. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Diyiluu uyaaba ti beni a diafwaana ukwatsimi mi dika vutulu pe. <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>Ka me sa nadiha mandaa, na buyeri, na mitaata mia beni mioosi a mituu utungululu beni pe. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Bibuti bia beni, na baana ba nguu ba beni, banduu, na bambaayi ba beni ba bebele, sa ba yeelele beni, na sa badusu balayi mu beni. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Boosi sa babele beni mu ndaa kuumbu a me. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Ka so linaanga limosi la mitswe mia beni a limatu pe. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Mu mukonono a beni, beni sadivuusu miwuumu mia beni.»<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsialili a Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mataayi 24.15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Malako 13.14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>«Bu beni dikaamono mikaanga mia masodaare mia diengelele Yeruselemi, diyaaba ti mu taanga dii, tsialili a yo yika bebele. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Mu taanga dii, bakaaba ku Yuuda, babata kutso milaanda, bakaaba kutso Yeruselemi, bapala, na bakaaba mu mala, banyaala ukoto mu ngaanda. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Ka sa biba biluumbu bia pfuundisi, paa moosi mabasonuu mayilimi. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Aa kipila ngebe mu Bakaasa bakaaba na mayimi na ba bakaanywiisi mu biluumbu bii! Ka sa muba na pasi dialaa mu tsi, na kesi a Nziaambi sa yibwa nha yulu a baata ba. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Sa badusu bo mu mukasa, sa babiti bo makori mu matsi ma bumweenyi, na Yeruselemi sa badiaata ku tsini a miili mia bangooyi, natee bu taanga dikaakuu.»<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzirili a Mwaana a muutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mataayi 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Malako 13.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>«Sa muba na biliimbi mu nyanga, mu tsuungi, na mu bambwelele. Naha yulu a toto, matsi sa maluulu mu boomo balaa mu ndaa kele a mubu na mapo ma maamba: <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>baata sa bakwa mu boomo mu ndaa utsimi mu mikaayira mu tsi. Ka tuu dia yula sa dinyingini. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Ka sa bamono Mwaana a muutu li mu uyira nha yulu a matuti na lituu, na buzitu balaa. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Bu maa makaabaanduu uyilimi, diba likanda na diba na ibaala, mu ndaa ti kuuyili a beni yika bebele.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsaba ya muti wa mufiike</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mataayi 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Malako 13.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Yiisu abwita bo tsaba: «Dikengese muti wa mufiike na miti mini moosi. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Bu beni dimono makaya mabaandii uteete, diyaabi ti, maangala maka mu uwa na mvulu a tsiomi ka bebele. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Bumosi, beni ka, bu dika mono mandaa maa maka mu uyilimi, diyaaba ti Ipfumu kia Nziaambi yika bebele. <verse eid="LUK 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>Ngwanya, me ndeeli kwaa beni: Kubu yi a yilabuu pe tswaamina a mandaa ma moosi muyilimi. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Yula na tsi sa bilabuu, ka mandaa ma me a mulabuu so holo pe.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndutu a uba likanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>«Disa mayele! Kele mitimi mia beni a mileme mu ndiilili na mu nywiilili a mala ya mifuri, na mu minioongo mia idiingi, paa ti iluumbu kii a iyabwiilili beni mu itsimbisini. <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>Ka kio sa iyira weti siele, nha yulu a baata boosi bali nha yulu a toto. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Diba likanda na dikuundu mu taanga dioosi, paa dibaa mifuri mia ubiingi mu mioosi mikaayira, na mu utemene nha kulu a Mwaana a muutu.»<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Mu nyanga, Yiisu akiyiisi mu nzo a Nziaambi. Ka tsitsii nde akipala mu ulabisa butsuu ku mulaanda wa kuumbu mulaanda Olive. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Ngwaali a ngwaali, baata boosi bakiyene ku nzo a Nziaambi mu uyuu nde.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Pfuundu a ndusili a Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mataayi 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Malako 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yowani 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Mukuungi a mapa ma hele liviiri wu bubaata Paaka ali bebele. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi na bayiisi ba mikele basiayi buni budusu Yiisu, ka bo bali na boomo ba baata.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuuda ayilimi mu uyeelele Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mataayi 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Malako 14.10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Ka Saatina akoti mu Yuuda wu bubaata Isikarioti, wali mosi mu miyii kuumi na mioolo. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Yuuda ayeni mu uyuhusunu na banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi, na bakuutu babakebi ba nzo a Nziaambi, mu usaa kuulu yi nde uyeelele Yissu kwaa bo. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Bo bayaangi, na bayuhisini mu uha nde mboongo. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Nde asiingi, na nde abaandii usaa taanga diafwaana mu uyeelele Yiisu kwaa bo kwa hele a baata ba yaaba.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzilimini a Paaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-19">Mataayi 26.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-16">Malako 14.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Iluumbu kia mukuungi a mapa mahele na lifunusu, ki bafwaana mu udusu baana ba mameme ma Paaka kiatoori. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Yiisu atsindi Peetero na Yowani, wabaleeli: «Diyene diyiluu bisi biloo bia Paaka, paa di diaanani.» <verse eid="LUK 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Bo bafuuli kwaa nde: «Kuni we tooni ti bisi diyiluu bio?» <verse eid="LUK 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Nde avutili kwaa bo: «Diyuu: bu beni dika koto mu ngaanda, beni sa dibwaanina na muutu mosi wabiti lisaanga la maamba, diduku nde mu nzo yi nde akaayakoto ya koto, <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>na dileele kwaa ngaa nzo: “Muyiisi leeli kwaa we: Mu ki itsuru kia nzo nidia biloo bia Paaka na miyii mia me?” <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Nde sa alaa beni itsuru ki inene ku etaze, ki babweeyise, ni kuu beni dika yiluu biloo bia Paaka.» <verse eid="LUK 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Bo bayeni, bamoni mandaa moosi weti bu nde aleeli kwa bo, na bayilii biloo bia Paaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Meese ma Pfumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-30">Mataayi 26.20-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-26">Malako 14.17-26</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-26">Yowani 13.21-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kolito 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Taanga bu dia atoori, Yiisu adiaali nha meese, na batumu ba nde. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Nde aleeli kwaa bo: «Me aba ngo nzala udia biloo bia Paaka bi na beni, tswaamina me ni mono pasi. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Ka me ni leeli kwa beni, me a nibwadia bio pe, natee bu tsutulu a ndaa yikaayilimi mu Ipfumu kia Nziaambi.» <verse eid="LUK 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Nde aholi mbasa, avutili matoondo, na aleeli: «Diholo yiinayi, na dikaba yo nha kati a beni; <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>ka me leeli kwaa beni, umata mu taanga di a nibwanywa viinyi pe natee Ipfumu kia Nziaambi iyira.» <verse eid="LUK 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Tumake nde aholi lipa, bu amani uvutulu matoondo kwaa Nziaambi, nde abukili lo na ahi lo kwaa bo, na aleeli: «Yiinayi ni nyutu a me, yibahi mu beni. Diyiluu buu, mu ulibili moonyi mu me.» <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Nde asi bumosi mu mbasa, nha mbisi a udia aleeli: «Mbasa yiinayi ni lilasina lilinyatii, layilimi mu makila ma me, mamatsiaamii mu beni. <verse eid="LUK 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>Ka dimono, wu uyeelele me li nha meese ma, na me. <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Mwaana a muutu sa akwa, weti bu Nziaambi ayesini, ki pili a ngebe kwaa muutu wuu, wu uyeelele nde.» <verse eid="LUK 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Na bo babaandii ufulusunu mu uyaaba na nha kati a bo utuu uyiluu ndaa ya pili yi.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Na avulu bunene nha kati a miyii?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Paa diabwi nha kati a bo: «Na nha kati a bo utuu umonuu weti wavulu bunene.» <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa bo: «Mitini mia matsi mili na litumu loosi nha yulu a matsi ma bo, na babali na litumu nha yulu a matsi maa batoono ti baata bata bo “Bayilii a mamabwe.” <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Ka kwaa beni a buli buu pe. Ka, wa wavulu bunene nha kati a beni, aba weti wavulu bungebe, na wuu wu utumu afwaana uba weti musiali. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Ka, na avulu mu bunene, wadiaala nha meese oo wuu uli mu usalila? A wa diaala nha meese pe? Ka bunu me ndi nha kati a beni weti musiali. <verse eid="LUK 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>Beni ni badianambiti mu me, mu taanga dia mapasi ma me. <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>Ni mu bu me heeri beni Ipfumu, mbii bu Taayi a me ahi me kio. <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/>Me heeri beni kio, paa ti beni didia na dinywa nha meese ma me, mu Ipfumu kia me, na beni sa didiaala nha mambata ma ipfumu mu ufuundusu bifuumbu kuumi na bioolo bia Iseraeli.»<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ayaabisi ti Peetero sa atunu nde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mataayi 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Malako 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yowani 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>«Simooni, Simooni! Yuu: Saatina aloombi litumu mu unyingisi beni boosi, weti bu bubaayengese looso. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Ka me nakuundi mu we, paa ti imiini kia we a iyadiimbili; na we, bu kaakiingili mayele, hamisa baana ba nguu ba we.» <verse eid="LUK 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Peetero aleeli kwaa nde: «Pfumu, me nayilimi mu uyene na we, na mu perese na mu likwa.» <verse eid="LUK 22:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Yiisu avutili kwaa nde: «Peetero, me leele kwa we, lolo li tswaamina tsutsu ukookolo, we sa tunu me mbala tata ti we ayaaba me pe.»<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ipokolo kia mboongo, kutu na mukasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Nde abwileele kwaa bo: «Bu me naditsindii beni kwa hele a ipokolo kia mboongo, so kutu, so bikoori, ima kia heli na beni?» Bo bavutuli: «A iloo pe.» <verse eid="LUK 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Nde aleeli kwaa bo: «Ka mu taanga di, wu li na ipokolo kia mboongo, aholo kio. Bumosi ka kwa uli na kutu, na wuu wa hele na mukasa, ayaluu ikutu kia nde, mu usuumbu mukasa. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Me leeli kwaa beni, bwafwaana ti Mabasonuu mayilimi mu me: “Nde ka bataangi nha kati a baa bahele na mikele.” Ka, Mabasonuu mu me maka mu uyilimi.» <verse eid="LUK 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Bo baleeli: «Pfumu mono mikasa mioolo.» Na nde aleeli kwaa bo: «Bu maakuu.»<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu akuundi ku mulaanda a olive</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mataayi 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Malako 14.32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Nde apali, na ayeni ku mulaanda a olive, mbii bwali ipfu kia nde. Miyii mia nde mia muduki. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Bu bo batoori nha mbuu yii, nde aleeli kwaa bo: «Dikuundu, paa di nyaala ubwa mu puusu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Na nde atakii na bo mu mwaa iteesi hoolo, na atsukini mu ukuundu, <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>aleeli: «Taata so lili litoono la we, maasa me mbasa yi. Ka a buli litoono la me pe, ka nyaala litoono la we liyilima» <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Ni mubuu tumu a Nziaambi amati ku yula, amonii kwa nde mu uhamisa nde. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Boomo bu ba mubwiilili, nde akuundi mu ibaala kialaa, na tuumu la nde lakitii weti mabete ma makila matsoli nha tsi. <verse eid="LUK 22:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Nha bisi a likuundu, nde atemini ayiri a uvutuu kwaa miyii, wababaasi bala tolo mu ndaa ngebe, <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Na nde aleeli kwaa bo: «Mu ima dilaari tolo? Ditemene dikuundu paa dihele ubwa mu puusu.»<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu bakaangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mataayi 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Malako 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yowani 18.3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Bu ali kene mu utsuu, mosi mu miyii kuumi na mioolo wu bu baata Yuuda abeyi koongi, asweesii kwaa Yiisu mu unyumbutu nde. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa nde: «Yuuda, mu unyumbutu we uyeelele Mwaana a muutu?» <verse eid="LUK 22:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Bu bamoni mamakeni uyiri, ba bali na Yiisu baleeli kwaa nde: «Pfumu, didwaana mu mukasa?» <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Na mosi mu bo ateti booyi la nguu a ngaanga a Nziaambi, na akesi nde litswi la koo kia babaala. <verse eid="LUK 22:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Ka Yiisu aleeli: «Dinyaala, bu maakuu.» Tumake nde abeembi litswi la booyi la nguu a ngaanga, na abeelisi nde. <verse eid="LUK 22:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi, kwaa bakuutu ba bakebi ba nzo a Nziaambi na bakuutu ba baata, babayiri mu ukaanga nde: «Beni dipali na mikasa na mipaanga weti ti me ali ihaangi? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Biluumbu bioosi me nali na beni mu nzo a Nziaambi, na beni a diakaangi me pe. Ka di taanga dia beni na lituu la pimisi.»<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Peetero atuni Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mataayi 26.57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Malako 14.53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yowani 18.12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Bu bakaangi Yiisu, bo babiti nde na bamuloosi mu nzo a nguu a bangaanga ba Nziaambi. Peetero aduki ku lala. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Bo bavuuti mbaa nha kati a mbari na badiaali. Peetero ali adiaali nha kati a bo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Booyi limosi la mukaasa lamoni Peetero adiaala nha mukoo a mbaa, atali nde isooso, na aleeli: «Wuunawu ka aba na nde.» <verse eid="LUK 22:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Ka nde wamutuni, aleeli: «A maama, me a nayaaba wa me nde pe.» <verse eid="LUK 22:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Idii pe, muutu mukimi amoni nde na aleeli: «Weka, li mosi mu bo!» Na Peetero avutili: «Ngori taata, a uli ngwanya pe.» <verse eid="LUK 22:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Nha bisi a nguungu mosi, mukimi ahami mu uleele: «Mu ngwanya, wuunawu ka aba na nde, ka nde li musi Ngalili.» <verse eid="LUK 22:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Peetero avutili: «Me a nayaaba pe ma we tooni uleele.» Nhaa-na-tsi, bu ali keni mu utsu, tsutsu akookili. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Ka Pfumu asieetii, na atali Peetero. Peetero alibili moonyi mu mandaa ma Pfumu aleeli kwa nde: «tswaamini tsutsu ukookolo lolo, we sa tunu me mbala tata.» <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Nde apali ku mbari, na alili mu ngebe dialaa.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu bamutuyi na bamuteti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mataayi 26.67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Malako 14.65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Babaala baki kebe Yiisu, bamutsori, na bamuteti. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Bo bafuyi nde busu na bafuuli nde, baleeli: «Bili! Leele na teti we?» <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Na bo babwituu nde bituyi bia mupili na mupili.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pfuundisi a Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mataayi 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Malako 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yowani 18.19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Bu busu bakieeri, bakuutu ba baata, na banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi na bayiisi ba mikele bakukini. Bo babiti Yiisu nha kulu a pfuundu a bakuutu ba banzioonzi ba Bayuudayo. <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>Bo baleeli: «So ni we li Kristo, leele bisi.» Nde avutili kwaa bo: «So me ndeeli beni, beni a disiingi so hoolo pe, <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>ka so me fuuli beni nduru, beni a divutulu so hoolo pe. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Ka umata mu taanga di, Mwaana a muutu sa adiaala nha koo kia babaala kia Nziaambi puungu lituu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Boosi baleeli: «Ka we ni mwaana a Nziaambi?» Nde avutili kwaa bo: «Beni bame dileeli ti me ni Mwaana a Nziaambi.» <verse eid="LUK 22:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Ni mu buu bo baleeli: «Bisi a dili na nzala a imbaangi ikimi pe! Bisi bame dimaayuu mandaa mu munywa a nde.»<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu nha kulu a Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mataayi 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Malako 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yowani 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Batemini boosi itwaari na babiti Yiisu nha kulu a Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Bo babaandii ufuundu nde, baleeli: «Bisi dibaasi muutu wu mu utsindi baata ba tsi a bisi paa badwaanisa litumu la tsi: nde li mu ulii bo ufutu limaanda kwaa Kayisari, na nde li mu uleele mu inde makulu ti nde ni Kristo, mutini.» <verse eid="LUK 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Pilato afuuli nde: «We ni mutini a Bayuudayo?» Nde avutili kwaa nde: «Ni we leeli buu.» <verse eid="LUK 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Pilato aleeli kwaa banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi na kwa koongi: «Me amoni toono ya uholo kesili mu muutu wu pe.» <verse eid="LUK 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Ka bo bahanini na baleeli: «Nziisili a nde yili mu utsindi baata mu udwaanisa litumu la tsi, umata mu Ngalili, mu nde abaandii, mu Yuuda yoosi, natee nhaa na nha.»<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu nha kulu a Erode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Bu Pilato ayuyi maa, afuuli mbii ti muutu wu ni musi Ngalili. <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Bu nde ayaabi ti Yiisu amati mu itinini kia tsi kia litumu la Erode, nde atsindii Yiisu kwaa Erode wali ka mu Yeruselemi mu biluumbu bii. <verse eid="LUK 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Bu Erode amoni Yiisu, nde ali na kinyi yalaa. Umata belepe ka nde ali na nzala umono nde, mu ndaa ma nde ayuyi baleeli mu nde, na nde ali na ilimbisi mu umono nde asa imaanga. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Nde afuuli nde manduru malaa, ka Yiisu a avutili nde pe. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi na bayiisi ba mikele bali nhaa, na bafutili nde mandaa mu iteesi kia mifuri. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Ka Erode ka, na masodaare ma nde, bamutsori; na bu bamani usiebe nde na ulwaatisi nde ikutu kia tala, nde abwivutulu Yiisu kwaa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Pilato na Erode bali mitaata, bavuutili imbaayi mu kiina iluumbu kii.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kesili a likwa la Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mataayi 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Malako 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yowani 18.39—19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Pilato akukii banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi, bakuutu na baata boosi, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>na aleeli kwaa bo: «Beni dibeyi me muutu wu mu ndaa ti nde li mu utsindi baata mu udwaanisa ipfumu kia tsi. Ka me fuuli nde nha kulu a beni, na me amoni toono yimbi mu nde pe yi beni dili mu ufuundu nde. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Erode ka a asolili toono yimbi mu nde pe, ka nde vutili bisi nde. Ni mu buu, a uli na ndaa yi nde asa pe yafwaana mu likwa. [ <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Me sa tumu bafiinzi nde bikoti, na nha mbisi me sa namunyaala.» <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>Mu pasi mukuungi a Paaka, Pilato ali na ipfu kia upalisa bo kori mosi uli mu perese.] <verse eid="LUK 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Ka bo boosi baloyi mu itwaari: «Dusu muutu wu, na nyaala bisi Barabase.» <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Barnaba ali baloosi mu perese mundaa bu punga-pungu bali mu ngaanda na mu ndaa ti nde adusi muutu. <verse eid="LUK 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Bu Pilato ali na nzala a unyaala Yiisu, nde abwileele bo ndaa yiina yii. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Ka bo baloyi: «Komo nde nha kuruwa! Komo nde nha kuruwa!» <verse eid="LUK 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Nde aleeli kwa bo mu mbala la mutata: «Ki ndaa yimbi nde ayiluu? Me amoni toono mu nde pe yafwaana mu likwa. Ni mu buu me sa nyaala nde, nha mbisi a utumu ti bafiinzi nde bikoti.» <verse eid="LUK 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Ka bo bahanini mu uloo mu mifuri, ba loombi: «Wamukomo nha kuruwa!» Na miloo mia bo mia biingi. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Pilato aholi kesili mu ukuusu litoono la bo. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Nde anyaali wu bo baloombi wali mu perese mu ndaa ikiindi na ndusili; ka nde ayeelili bo Yiisu paa bayiluu mu nde pasi mi bo batoono.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu bamukomi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mataayi 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Malako 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yowani 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Bu bo babiti nde, bo baholi Simooni musi Kirene, wakimata ku matsie, na bo bamukwiyi kuruwa paa nde abiti yo nha mbisi a Yiisu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Koongi yinene ya baata yaduki nde, na Bakaasa bakilili na unioongo mu nde. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Yiisu asieetii kwaa bo na aleeli: «Bakaasa ba Yeruselemi, a dilili mu me pe; ka dilili mu benime na mu baana ba beni. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>Ka biluumbu biyiri bi bakaa leele: “Kinyi kwaa Bakaasa ba bikumbu, kinyi kwaa mioonyo miahele ubutu, na mabeene mahele unywiisi!” <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Ka sa babaleele kwa milaanda miminene: “Dibwa nha yulu a bisi”, na kwaa milaanda mimikee: “Diswee bisi!” <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Ka mbii basiiri buu kwaa muti wu mubisi, buni bukaaba kwaa muti wa kaya?» <verse eid="LUK 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Babeyi mu taanga dii, biwulu bioolo bikimi, mu udusu bio na Yiisu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Bu batoori nha mbuu yi bu baa ta «Iteenge kia mutswe», bo bakomi nde nhaa, na biwulu bio bia bioolo. Mosi nha koo kia babaala na wu mumosi nha koo kia bakaasa. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Yiisu aleeli: «Taata, sa bo kolokolo, ka aba yaba pe mi bali mu uyiluu.» Bo bati nzeke mu ukaba bikutu bia nde. <verse eid="LUK 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Baata batemini nhaa na bakitala. Ka bakuutu bakisa nde saa, baleeli: «Nde avuusu bakimi; nyaala avuu ndeme akulu, mbii ti nde Kristo, wu Nziaambi asoolo!» <verse eid="LUK 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Masodaare ka masi nde saa, bo baswesii na bahi nde viinyi la nhanyi. <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>Na baleeli: «so we ni mutini a Bayuudayo, vuusu nyutu a we!» <verse eid="LUK 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Nha yulu a mutswe a nde, mwali na bisonii bi: «Wuunawu ni mutini a Bayuudayo.» <verse eid="LUK 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Mosi mu biwulu bi bakomi nha kuruwa atuuyi Yiisu wamuleeli: «We a ni Kristo pe? Vuu mu iweme na vuusu bisi ka!» <verse eid="LUK 23:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Ka wu mu mosi asieembi mbaayi na wamuleeli: «We a ubaabata Nziaambi boomo pe? Bunu weli kutso tsieembili moosi na nde. <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Kwaa we na me, tsieembili a bisi yasuungunu, ni mubuu dili mu ufutu ma mabi ma diayiluu, ka wuunawu a ayiluu ndaa so mosi yimbi pe.» <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Na nde abwileele: «Yiisu libili me moonyi mu taanga di we kaayira mu ipfumu kia we.» <verse eid="LUK 23:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Yiisu avutili kwaa nde: «Ngwanya, me ni leele kwaa we lolo li: we saba na me ku paradiso.»<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwa la Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mataayi 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Malako 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yowani 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Taanga dia nzanga bu diali ka bebele, pimisi diabwi mu tsi yoosi natee mu nguungu ya mutata nha mbisi a nzanga. <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>Nyanga bu yali keni yasweeme, ngumbu ya Nzo a Nziaambi yakakii nha kati a kati. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Yiisu aloyi mu ndaa yi inene, aleeli: «Taata, nha mioo mia we me nzieelili muwuumu a me.» Bu aleeli buu, asieeli muwuumu. <verse eid="LUK 23:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Mukuutu a masodaare bu amoni moosi mayilimi, akiinzi Nziaambi, aleeli: «Ngwanya! Wuunawu beeri muutu wa libweeye.» <verse eid="LUK 23:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Baata boosi ba bakukini mu umono mandaa maa, bu bamoni mayilimi, bavutii na bakiyene a kubulu mapfuuku mu minyoongo. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Banduu ba Yiisu na Bakaasa bakiduku nde umata ku Ngalili, batemini nha lilala, mu utalila makilabu.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu basuusi mu ngila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mataayi 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Malako 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yowani 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Mwali muutu mosi mu pfuundu a bakuutu ba banzioonzi ba Bayuudayo, kuumbu a nde Yoosefi, muutu wu mubwe na wa libweeye, <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>nde a asiingi pe kesilili na biyiluu bia bambaayi. Nde ni musi Arimataya, ngaanda a Bayuudayo, na nde akikebe Ipfumu kia Nziaambi. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Nde ayeni kwaa Pilato, na aloombi nyutu a Yiisu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Nde asutili yo nha kuruwa, adii yo tsaanda a liino, na asuusi yo mu ngili yi basootolo mu manya, mwali keni a badii muutu pe. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Ali iluumbu kia uyilimi mu saba, na hoolo yasiaali ti saba yibaanduu. <verse eid="LUK 23:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Bakaasa ba baduki Yiisu, umata ku Ngalili, bayeni na Yoosefi, bo bamoni ngila a Yiisu na mbii bu basuusi nyutu a nde. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Na bo bavutii, mu uyiluu mananaasa na maari, tumake mu iluumbu kia saba, bo bawuumi mbii bwali mikele.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Tsimbilili a Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mataayi 28.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Malako 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yowani 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Mu iluumbu kia tsiomi kia limiingi mu ngwaali a ngwaali, Bakaasa bayeni ku ngili, babiti mananaasa ma bo bayilii. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Bo bayibaasa manya lali lafuu munywa a ngila banyiingili nha peembi; <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Bo bakoti, ka a basolili nyutu a Pfumu Yiisu pe. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Bu bali afulusunu, babaala boolo balwaata matsaanda mangeyini bamonii kwaa bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Bu Bakaasa bamoni boomo, babaandisi biinzi bia bo mu tsi, ka babaala baa baleeli kwaa bo: «Mu ima dili mu usaa wu li moonyi mu babakwa? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>Nde a ali nha pe, ka siimbiangi wa nde. Dilibili moonyi mu mi nde aleeli beni mu taanga di nde abeeri keni ku Ngalili: <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>“Bwafaana ti bayeelele Mwaana a muutu nha mioo mia bangaa masumu, paa bakomo nde nha kuruwa, na asiimbuu mu iluumbu kia bitata.”» <verse eid="LUK 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Bakaasa balibili moonyi mu mandaa ma nde. <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Bo bamati ku ngila na bayeni mu uyayaabisa maa moosi kwaa batumu kuumi na mosi na kwaa miyii mini mioosi. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Ali Mari, musi Mangadala, na Zaana, na Mari, nguu a Yaki, na Bakaasa bakimi ba bali na bo baleeli mandaa maa kwaa batumu. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Ka bo batsimi ti mandaa ma babaleeli kwaa bo mahele a tsala, na a babasi imiini pe. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Ka Peetero atemini, ayeni mawasa ku ngila. Bu abaandini amoni ndila matsaanda ma liino. Akimii ndaa mu moosi mayilimi na avutii ku nzo a nde.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu kuulu a Emausi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Malako 16.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Mono, iluumbu kii, mioolo mu miyii miayeni ku bula ba kuumbu Emawusi, batakuu na Yeruselemi, mu iteesi kia bakilometre kuumi na mosi. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Babayi imoo nha kati a bo mu maa moosi malabii. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Bu bakitsuu na ufulusunu, nde makulu Yiisu asweesi, na avuuti na bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Bamumoni, ka a batuyi uyaaba nde pe. <verse eid="LUK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa bo: «Mu ki mandaa beni dili mu yolo, bu dili mu uyene?» Batsikini na mabusu ma bo mali na ngebe. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Mosi mu bo, kuumbu a nde Kleopa, avutili, aleeli kwaa nde: «Ka ndila we mu Yeruselemi, wahele uyaaba mabwi nha mu biluumbu bi?» <verse eid="LUK 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Aleeli kwaa bo: «Ki ma ndaa?» Baleeli kwaa nde: «Ma mu Yiisu, ni musi Nazareti, wabeeri mibili wa lituu mu biyiluu na mu mandaa nha kulu a Nziaambi na baata boosi. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi na bakuutu ba bisi bayeelili nde mu uha nde tsieembili ya likwa, na bamukomi nha kuruwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Bisi diasi ilimbisi ti nde wa keni kuulu Iseraeli, ka lolo ni iluumbu kia bitata, umatuu bu bayiluu mandaa maa mayilimi. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Diali na dungunguu mu ndaa ti Bakaasa ba bamosi nha kati a bisi bayeni ngwaali a ngwaali yi ku ngila. <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>Ka bu bahele usololo nyutu a nde, bo bayileele ti batumu ba Nziaambi bamonii kwaa bo, na baleeli bo ti Yiisu li moonyi. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Ba bamosi mu ba bali na bisi bayeni ku ngila, bamoni bioosi mbii bwaleeli Bakaasa, ka nde a bamumoni pe.» <verse eid="LUK 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa bo: «Beni a dili na mayele pe. Mitimi mia beni mia leme mu usa imiini mu moosi maleeli mibili! <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Ali abwafwaana pe ti Kristo amono pasi dia buu, tswaamina nde ukoto mu buzitu ba nde?» <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Tumake, nde wababiindili moosi ma basonuu mu mandaa ma Nziaambi mu ndaa nde. Nde wababiindili mo ubaanduu mu mikaanda mia Mooso natee mu mikaanda mioosi mia mibili. <verse eid="LUK 24:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Bu batoori nha peembi a bula ba bakiyene, nde asi weti wu ulabuu. <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Bo bamupeli, baleeli: «Ba na bisi, ka tsitsii yimaato, busu baka mu uyili.» Nde akoti mu udiaala na bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Bu adiaali na bo nha meese, nde a holi lipa, avutili matoondo kwaa Nziaambi, abukili na wabahi lo. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Ni mu buu, miisi mia bo mia dibini, bamuyaabi; ka nde adiimbili nha kulu a bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Baleelisini: «Mitimi mia bisi mialuuli mu kinyi mu kuulu, bu nde abeeri abiindili bisi, ma basonuu.» <verse eid="LUK 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Mu diina taanga dii, bo batemini, bavutii ku Yeruselemi, babaasi kuumi na mosi bakukunu na babali na bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>Boosi baleeli kwaa miyii mioolo mii: «Mu ngwanya Pfumu siimbiangi na moniaangi kwaa Simooni.» <verse eid="LUK 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Miyii mioolo mialeeli kwaa bo mioosi mialabii mu kula na buni bo bamuyaabi bu nde akibukulu lipa.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu amonii kwaa miyii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mataayi 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Malako 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yowani 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Biyiluu 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Bu bali bakeni mu utsu, Yiisu nde makulu amonii nha kati a bo, aleeli: «Iyeenge kwaa beni!» <verse eid="LUK 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Bo babayi boomo balaa, batehiti na batsimi ti bo bamoni iduuru. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Ka Yiisu aleeli kwaa bo: «Mu ima matsimi ma beni mali mutele-mutele na dili na maketi-keti mu mitimi mia beni? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Dimono mioo na miili mia me, ni me wa me. Dibeembe me, dikengese me, ka Iduuru a ili na musunyi na miyisi weti bu me ndi pe.» <verse eid="LUK 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Bu akileele buu, wabamwesi mioo na miili mia nde. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Ka bu bali keni kutso kinyi na ukimuu, a batuyi usa imiini pe natee bu Yiisu aleeli kwaa bo: «A dili na iloo kia udia nha pe?» <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Bamu hii itsuru kia tswi ki bakaanga. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>A holi kio, na adi nha kulu a bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Tumake nde aleeli kwaa bo: «Ma ni mandaa ma me naleeli beni bu nali na beni, ti moosi ma basonuu mu me mu mikele mia Mooso, mu mibili, na mu mikuunga, mafwaana mu uyilimi.» <verse eid="LUK 24:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Ni mu buu nde adibili mayele ma bo paa bayaaba tsutulu a ma basonuu. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>Na aleeli kwaa bo: «Mono, bu ni bwasonomo: Kristo afwaana umono pasi na usiimbuu mu babakwa mu iluumbu kia bitata, <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>mu kuumbu a nde sa bayiisi kiingili a mayele na uleele nyaalili a masumu kwaa bifuumbu bioosi, ubaanduu mu Yeruselemi. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Beni ni bambaangi ba mandaa ma. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Mono, me ni tsinduu beni mi Taayi a me a lasini beni. Ka beni didiaala mu ngaanda natee bu beni dika lwaata lituu la yula.»<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ahaati ku yula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Malako 16.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Biyiluu 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Nha mbisi a nhaa, Yiisu abiti miyii mia nde natee ku peembi a Betania, anaangili mioo mia nde ku yula, na wabasiemi. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Bu nde akisieme bo, nde akinaanguu, na ahaati ku yula. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Miyii bu miamani ubili Yiisu, bo bavutii ku Yeruselemi mu kinyi yalaa. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Bo bali mu nzo a Nziaambi taanga dioosi na bakikiinzanga Nziaambi.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
